1
00:02:15,020 --> 00:02:20,599
Devil's dog!
Now you will witness the sword of justice.

2
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:27,159
Your time has come.

3
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:32,319
Countless few have triumphed over
countless many. The time has come.

4
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:38,479
Osman help!

5
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:42,159
Bala!

6
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,559
Osman

7
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:46,039
-Bala! 
-Help!

8
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:55,519
Osman! Help!

9
00:03:01,040 --> 00:03:02,839
Hang on.

10
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:06,359
Give me your hand! Give
me your hand, my daughter!

11
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:09,919
Come on!

12
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:32,839
Commander Lukas!

13
00:03:33,880 --> 00:03:35,919
Soldiers, attack!

14
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:39,519
Come on, this way!

15
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:45,039
Commander... -Where is Osman?
-He ran away, my Commander.

16
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:46,279
He ran away?

17
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:47,919
Let's go after him.

18
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:18,319
What are we going to do now?

19
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:22,679
We will do what we need to
do with these swords we have.

20
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:28,519
We will wash these swords..

21
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:31,599
...with those dogs' blood.

22
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:35,959
We cannot let Osman go, Ulugan.

23
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:39,399
They don't have the chance to leave this place.

24
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,719
Ulugan...

25
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:44,079
Let's catch Osman.

26
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,719
Osman..

27
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:55,479
...and his family cannot
run away from us. Altuga.

28
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:58,559
You will handle these ones.

29
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,559
Come on, let's go to Osman.

30
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:04,519
Don't let any of them survive, Altuga.

31
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,079
Ilbay...

32
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:12,559
..you..

33
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:16,079
...you are a dog who betrays...

34
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:19,679
...people from your own
blood and your own people.

35
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:21,679
And from now on...

36
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:24,839
...you will die as a traitor.

37
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:28,279
The sultanate of traitors are always destroyed.

38
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:30,119
That throne...

39
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:31,879
...will be your nightmare.

40
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:33,639
Don't worry.

41
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:40,039
Enough. Soldiers...

42
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:43,839
...let's cool down these
furious men's fire! Come on!

43
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:46,799
Allah is the Greatest! Come on!

44
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:09,559
My Shahzades!
-Bogac, Bahadir. What are you doing here?

45
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:12,839
We couldn't have waited there
in this hard day, my Shahzade.

46
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:14,679
Why didn't you stay with our people?

47
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:16,639
Alps must stand next to their Bey, my Shahzade.

48
00:06:16,640 --> 00:06:19,799
Now the swords will get
stronger with Mongols' blood!

49
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:23,239
Draw your swords! Come on! Come on Alaeddin!

50
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,279
Come on!

51
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:50,559
Gonca, are you alright?

52
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:52,159
Come on my rose. Come on.

53
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:06,359
Are you alright?

54
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:12,999
Come on. Come on. Holofira!

55
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:41,959
Furious boy, here we are
again. But this is the last time.

56
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:43,599
I will kill you.

57
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:45,919
I will make your excitement disappear.

58
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:06,519
With that hole in your hand, who
do you trust to attack me, huh?

59
00:08:06,520 --> 00:08:11,879
We fear none but Allah. We seek
refuge in Allah alone. Now, here, dog...

60
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:14,719
...now, here, the time for your death has come.

61
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:16,399
Come on, make your move then.

62
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:29,319
Brother!

63
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:32,119
We need to retreat into the forest, come on!

64
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:35,279
We'll dive into the forest
and split them in two.

65
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:39,078
Aykurt, Ayaz, we'll go north, come on!
-Nokers (Mongolian Soldiers)!

66
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,999
Attack, come on!

67
00:08:42,159 --> 00:08:43,639
I will rip your heart out!

68
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:45,839
I will not even let birds and wolves eat it.

69
00:08:47,160 --> 00:08:52,759
Yagiz, Turahan, come with me!

70
00:09:01,160 --> 00:09:04,399
Bahadir, Bogac you two head south quickly.

71
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:07,719
Come on! Come on!

72
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:09,519
Go after Alaeddin!

73
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:15,159
Leave Orhan to me! I will eat him!

74
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:34,279
Where is Osman?

75
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:36,359
He ran away.

76
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,919
All these soldiers...

77
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:43,319
And you let him run away, huh?

78
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,719
He can't get far.

79
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,879
Let's send soldiers after him.

80
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:51,759
Even if he gets far, Osman
will not leave these lands.

81
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:54,039
He will face us sooner or later.

82
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,879
Hatun is right.

83
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:59,759
Osman would never leave these lands. 
Nokers(Mongolian Soldiers)!

84
00:09:59,760 --> 00:10:01,279
Search around!

85
00:10:05,760 --> 00:10:07,519
We'll go to the tribe.

86
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:11,319
We can't leave the tribe
without a leader. Let's go.

87
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,079
Lukas.

88
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:22,479
Where is Poena? How is she?

89
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:27,919
I barely escaped death, and
you are asking me about Poena?

90
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:33,799
Don't worry, she held her
mother's and father's hands and left.

91
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:09,639
Orhan..

92
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:13,559
Holofira..

93
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:17,479
Holofira..

94
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:23,399
Are you alright? Come. Come.

95
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:27,319
Are you alright?

96
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:30,599
I have a headache.

97
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:34,399
Give some water.

98
00:11:35,920 --> 00:11:38,199
Open your hands.

99
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:46,039
You are alright? You are.

100
00:11:46,040 --> 00:11:49,439
-I am feeling better.
-Good.

101
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:51,879
This way!

102
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,039
Orhan.

103
00:11:54,160 --> 00:11:56,239
Orhan, they found us. They are coming!

104
00:11:57,040 --> 00:11:58,959
Move. Move.

105
00:12:00,080 --> 00:12:01,719
Aykurt. -My Shahzade.

106
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:03,799
No one knows this place better than you.

107
00:12:03,800 --> 00:12:05,479
Now you will take these with you...

108
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:08,239
...and ride your horse south
to the Black Forest area.

109
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,639
Don't worry my Shahzade.

110
00:12:09,640 --> 00:12:12,057
I will get over them at the
Black Forest God willing.

111
00:12:12,069 --> 00:12:12,879
Okay.

112
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:16,479
Come on Holofira, come on.

113
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:30,479
Stop... stop.

114
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:14,199
So you are going this way, huh?

115
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:17,639
Nokers(Mongolian Soldiers)! To horses!

116
00:13:22,680 --> 00:13:24,119
Come on!

117
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:35,439
They've gone.

118
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:37,559
We can rest a little here.

119
00:13:38,200 --> 00:13:39,999
Then we will keep going.

120
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:44,439
Holofira.

121
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:47,679
Are you alright?

122
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:50,239
As long as you're with me,

123
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:52,119
...I'm good.

124
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:56,999
Besides I'm a Kayi girl now.

125
00:13:57,640 --> 00:13:59,519
These trouble can do me no harm.

126
00:13:59,920 --> 00:14:02,079
Beyond being a Kayi girl

127
00:14:02,640 --> 00:14:05,519
...you'll deliver a child for the state.

128
00:14:06,640 --> 00:14:08,879
My lifeful-eyed wife.

129
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:13,679
Orhan..

130
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:16,279
Everybody is in terrible situation.

131
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:20,279
I hope we can get rid of these
troubles as soon as possible.

132
00:14:20,560 --> 00:14:23,319
...so we can revive people's broken hopes.

133
00:14:23,680 --> 00:14:25,079
We will.

134
00:14:25,520 --> 00:14:26,999
For sure, we will.

135
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:29,079
We should save father first.

136
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:34,519
Then we all will work together
and turn these fruitful lands...

137
00:14:35,280 --> 00:14:38,359
...into the paradise of the world, God willing.

138
00:14:42,520 --> 00:14:45,279
-Orhan, Mongolians.
-Let's go.

139
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:12,799
-Brother.
-Big brother.

140
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:16,919
-Thanks to Allah, you are fine.
-We're good.

141
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:21,079
The forest is the wolf's home,
brother. Nobody can hurt us here.

142
00:15:22,760 --> 00:15:26,359
-Holofira, are you alright?
-I'm fine. Don't worry.

143
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:31,599
-Our father is also fine.
-What?

144
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:34,079
What are you saying? How?

145
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:36,159
I don't know how.

146
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:38,519
But they escaped from that dog.

147
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:43,559
My Allah... Thank You, my Allah.

148
00:15:43,880 --> 00:15:46,999
-Thanks to Allah.
-Thanks to Allah.

149
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:51,759
The cryings of the bear called Ulugan
was echoing all around the forest.

150
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:55,519
We'll skin that bear when it's time, for sure.

151
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:58,279
We will, God willing.

152
00:15:58,440 --> 00:16:02,119
Osman is saved now and they'll be in trouble.

153
00:16:02,520 --> 00:16:06,599
Yes, they will. Let's go to the hidden place.

154
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:08,559
My father will be there too.

155
00:16:08,560 --> 00:16:10,119
Let's go.

156
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:25,599
It looks fine. You're good. You're
stronger than you look, Saruca.

157
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:30,439
I hit your abdomen and thought you
wouldn't wake up easily. Drink this.

158
00:16:37,960 --> 00:16:40,079
Finish it off.

159
00:16:47,280 --> 00:16:49,439
I thought you'd kill me for a moment.

160
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:53,239
But you made a good plan not to kill me.

161
00:16:55,160 --> 00:16:58,719
-You hit exactly my abdomen.
-It was a good plan.

162
00:16:59,280 --> 00:17:02,119
You aren't as weak as you look.

163
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:07,159
Anyway... When you stand
up, I will make you pay.

164
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:11,439
Yusuf.

165
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:14,877
How can we deal with those demons?

166
00:17:18,040 --> 00:17:20,239
I'll go back to the tribe.

167
00:17:21,358 --> 00:17:24,039
And keep looking as if I
were taking Ulugan's side.

168
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:27,396
Take that horse and find Osman Bey somehow.

169
00:17:27,520 --> 00:17:29,839
And tell him I'm loyal to him.

170
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:33,999
I'll be his eyes in that tribe
and waiting for his orders.

171
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:39,799
Thank you.

172
00:17:40,200 --> 00:17:42,199
I'm good at tracking.

173
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:45,119
But how will I deliver the news to you?

174
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:47,319
Not near the tribe.

175
00:17:50,320 --> 00:17:53,039
Leave a note in this tree's hole.

176
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:55,159
And I'll take it from there.

177
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:58,399
Alright?

178
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:02,959
Come on. Easy. In the name of Allah.

179
00:18:03,040 --> 00:18:06,119
-Here we go. In the name of Allah.
-Come on.

180
00:18:11,120 --> 00:18:12,399
Yusuf.

181
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:18,839
...it would be easier for you
to win Fatma Hatun's heart.

182
00:18:19,120 --> 00:18:21,119
You missed an opportunity.

183
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:24,839
I don't like easy races,
Saruca. Don't you know that?

184
00:18:24,840 --> 00:18:28,039
When you restore your
strength, we will compete again.

185
00:18:28,160 --> 00:18:30,599
-Okay.
-Come on!

186
00:18:39,950 --> 00:18:41,030
Welcome!

187
00:18:41,030 --> 00:18:43,929
Osman Bey Secret Tents

188
00:18:48,680 --> 00:18:50,399
This is it, huh?

189
00:18:52,760 --> 00:18:54,679
Father.

190
00:18:56,800 --> 00:18:59,999
Thanks to Allah, you're back.

191
00:19:00,240 --> 00:19:01,999
You're back.

192
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:04,559
You're back alive, huh?

193
00:19:04,760 --> 00:19:07,399
I'm back, my dear. I'm fine. Don't worry.

194
00:19:07,680 --> 00:19:10,639
-Are you alright?
-I'm good. We're good, father.

195
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:14,999
As you are here with us now,
all our problems will be solved.

196
00:19:19,280 --> 00:19:20,719
My brothers?

197
00:19:21,600 --> 00:19:23,199
Where are they?

198
00:19:25,600 --> 00:19:27,439
There they are.

199
00:19:27,880 --> 00:19:29,839
-My Bey. -Father!

200
00:19:31,160 --> 00:19:32,399
My sons.

201
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:36,359
My sons.

202
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:38,039
Orhan.

203
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:42,239
Thankfully, Allah spared your life for us.

204
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:48,039
-Thank you, thank you. Alaaddin.
-My Bey.

205
00:19:48,600 --> 00:19:52,239
Thanks to Allah.
Thanks to Allah.

206
00:20:01,320 --> 00:20:05,559
I feel grateful to my Allah who let me...

207
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:12,679
...a father to children like you
and a bey to brave people like you!

208
00:20:12,800 --> 00:20:15,119
Thanks to Allah, my Bey!

209
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:25,599
During my absence

210
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:29,759
...you never fell into despair.

211
00:20:30,400 --> 00:20:32,199
To able to exist and...

212
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:35,959
...be united in peace,

213
00:20:36,320 --> 00:20:39,719
...you did whatever should be done to heathens!

214
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:41,959
Thank you, my people!

215
00:20:42,080 --> 00:20:44,759
Sure, my Bey!

216
00:20:54,520 --> 00:21:00,199
I swear to this glorious flag
that we lost many lives for.

217
00:21:00,280 --> 00:21:02,639
We swear, my Bey!

218
00:21:09,720 --> 00:21:13,679
I swear to mothers whose
eyes are filled with tears...

219
00:21:14,240 --> 00:21:18,479
...and warriors who watered
this holy land with their blood.

220
00:21:18,600 --> 00:21:20,319
We swear, my Bey!

221
00:21:20,320 --> 00:21:25,319
I swear to our cause that we spread all around
the world with the wings of our horses...

222
00:21:25,600 --> 00:21:31,239
...and our faith that is burning
in our chests like a wild fire!

223
00:21:31,240 --> 00:21:33,039
We swear, my Bey!

224
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:36,239
I swear to this tribe of three tents!

225
00:21:36,960 --> 00:21:41,639
God willing, this place
will be Ergenekon for Kayi!

226
00:21:41,920 --> 00:21:44,359
God willing, my Bey!

227
00:21:45,960 --> 00:21:50,639
The resurrection fire we
build will burn heathens alive!

228
00:21:50,840 --> 00:21:59,319
-Allah is the greatest!
-Allah is the greatest!

229
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:02,759
-Allah is the greatest!
-Allah is the greatest!

230
00:23:10,800 --> 00:23:13,159
You lost..

231
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:20,239
...first Osman and then his babies!

232
00:23:21,120 --> 00:23:24,719
You made mistakes one after another, Altuga.

233
00:23:31,320 --> 00:23:33,919
To pay the price of all your mistakes

234
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:36,719
...you won't wait for meeting Tamu.

235
00:23:37,080 --> 00:23:42,959
You will suffer from Ulugan's
wrath before Erlik Khan's torture.

236
00:23:51,040 --> 00:23:56,239
I'd sacrifice my life for Erlik
Khan and my head for Ulugan.

237
00:23:57,240 --> 00:23:59,239
This fire isn't enough for me.

238
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:01,639
Cut off my head, Ulugan.

239
00:24:01,800 --> 00:24:05,359
Send me the burning pits of hell.

240
00:24:16,120 --> 00:24:20,319
No. You know, Altuga.

241
00:24:21,160 --> 00:24:24,679
I always give the mistaken a
chance to make up for a mistake.

242
00:24:32,920 --> 00:24:36,079
Nokers(Mongolian Soldiers), extinguish it.

243
00:24:58,040 --> 00:25:00,279
Now get out of my sight.

244
00:25:03,120 --> 00:25:08,039
May you burn in flames forever, dastard!

245
00:25:08,320 --> 00:25:13,399
-Go away, come on!
-Go away!

246
00:25:18,040 --> 00:25:21,799
The mistake you made near the cliff, Lukas.

247
00:25:24,480 --> 00:25:27,639
Altuga isn't the only one
I'm giving another chance.

248
00:25:28,600 --> 00:25:30,039
For your information.

249
00:25:31,880 --> 00:25:37,639
My knights are holding the borders.
I'm ready to help in any way, Ulugan.

250
00:25:38,360 --> 00:25:40,999
Osman can never escape from my land.

251
00:25:41,560 --> 00:25:43,519
Sooner or later, we'll find him.

252
00:25:43,880 --> 00:25:46,999
Until then, we want to stay here...

253
00:25:47,680 --> 00:25:50,119
...and be allies.

254
00:26:07,600 --> 00:26:09,999
Did you bury Saruca, brother?

255
00:26:11,800 --> 00:26:13,519
Don't feel upset.

256
00:26:14,000 --> 00:26:15,879
You did the right thing.

257
00:26:24,280 --> 00:26:26,759
In the name of Allah, 
the merciful, the compassionate.

258
00:26:28,200 --> 00:26:31,039
Osman Bey Secret Tents

259
00:26:44,800 --> 00:26:46,479
My Bey.

260
00:26:49,120 --> 00:26:51,079
Thank you, Bala.

261
00:26:51,880 --> 00:26:55,799
This is the best we could make
with things we collect around.

262
00:26:56,280 --> 00:26:58,399
We have little food but it's halal.

263
00:26:58,560 --> 00:27:01,079
Well, we have little food.

264
00:27:02,200 --> 00:27:03,239
But it's blessed.

265
00:27:04,440 --> 00:27:08,799
This affection cannot be found
in any other meals in the world.

266
00:27:21,680 --> 00:27:22,959
My Osman..

267
00:27:23,640 --> 00:27:25,399
Aren't you going to eat?

268
00:27:33,480 --> 00:27:35,839
I am not hungry, my Bala. I am not.

269
00:27:35,840 --> 00:27:38,519
First, our children and our valiants will eat.

270
00:27:38,840 --> 00:27:41,919
No. We cannot do that, father.

271
00:27:42,250 --> 00:27:45,739
You need to gain your strength.
We have a long way to g -Yes.

272
00:27:45,739 --> 00:27:49,559
Yes, look, you didn't even have the table
set up in the tent. It's cold outside.

273
00:27:49,560 --> 00:27:51,399
Eat some, huh?

274
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:56,199
Bala, in this state, when they are outside...

275
00:27:56,200 --> 00:28:02,039
...I can't sit in a tent. It's better to...

276
00:28:02,680 --> 00:28:04,679
...stay with them.

277
00:28:05,320 --> 00:28:09,999
Alright. Our city is gone.

278
00:28:11,200 --> 00:28:14,679
But our laws will always remain.

279
00:28:15,560 --> 00:28:24,399
We always found what we couldn't find in
palaces, in inns; in the mountains and forests.

280
00:28:24,840 --> 00:28:26,439
Don't worry.

281
00:28:26,800 --> 00:28:31,159
We have the strength to ignite
the fire of resurrection, for sure.

282
00:28:31,920 --> 00:28:34,679
Thank Allah. Thank Allah.

283
00:28:34,680 --> 00:28:37,679
Thank Allah, my Bey. But my Bey...

284
00:28:38,040 --> 00:28:41,619
This treason of Ilbay...
How could such a traitor...

285
00:28:41,631 --> 00:28:45,079
...come from the Kayi, from
us? I can't understand.

286
00:28:49,360 --> 00:28:50,599
If you want to...

287
00:28:51,680 --> 00:28:56,479
...see the real Kayi, look at Ayse.

288
00:29:12,840 --> 00:29:13,879
This is...

289
00:29:15,680 --> 00:29:18,159
...the dagger of my uncle Sungur Tekin.

290
00:29:18,920 --> 00:29:22,639
Here you can see the courage of a child...

291
00:29:23,520 --> 00:29:28,439
...and the symbol of a nation's salvation.

292
00:29:34,880 --> 00:29:37,679
To save me, Ayse gave me this dagger.

293
00:29:40,800 --> 00:29:46,199
Our Ayse has shown with her
heart that she is the child of our tribe.

294
00:29:46,200 --> 00:29:48,759
Right. She did.

295
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:54,079
Ayse will help and support Ghazi...

296
00:29:54,720 --> 00:29:56,839
She won't leave him alone, right?

297
00:29:57,280 --> 00:29:59,559
She won't, my Hatun, she won't.

298
00:30:00,400 --> 00:30:03,199
Don't worry, we will take Ghazi.

299
00:30:03,200 --> 00:30:06,599
Ghazi will be alright. We will take him.

300
00:30:06,920 --> 00:30:10,439
Right, my Bey? We will take Ghazi.
-We will.

301
00:30:10,760 --> 00:30:13,679
We will take Ghazi and take our state back.

302
00:30:13,680 --> 00:30:15,319
Don't worry.

303
00:30:15,960 --> 00:30:19,319
Now, let's eat our food first.

304
00:30:19,400 --> 00:30:22,759
We need to gather our strength and power again.

305
00:30:23,160 --> 00:30:25,799
Come on. Enjoy.

306
00:30:36,960 --> 00:30:38,119
My Allah..

307
00:30:39,040 --> 00:30:41,519
Let Osman Bey sit on his throne again.

308
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:45,879
May our state be saved.

309
00:30:47,960 --> 00:30:52,759
And make me a means for
this salvation, my Allah. Aameen.

310
00:30:56,400 --> 00:31:00,999
You beg in vain, Ghazi.
We will never be defeated.

311
00:31:03,160 --> 00:31:06,239
We are the strong ones. Mongols.

312
00:31:06,240 --> 00:31:09,079
Are you strong?

313
00:31:09,080 --> 00:31:13,599
Ulugan uses you. He wouldn't care if you died.

314
00:31:14,240 --> 00:31:16,119
He has no mercy on anyone.

315
00:31:16,800 --> 00:31:20,959
He is not human, uncle. Nor
is anyone who stands by him.

316
00:31:21,600 --> 00:31:24,799
But my Osman Bey is different.

317
00:31:25,560 --> 00:31:29,199
He sees my father and
his Alps like his own brother.

318
00:31:30,520 --> 00:31:33,759
I wish you were one of us, uncle.

319
00:31:35,240 --> 00:31:37,039
I wish you were human.

320
00:31:39,280 --> 00:31:40,399
What we need...

321
00:31:41,440 --> 00:31:46,359
...is not humanity, Ghazi, but strength.

322
00:31:49,280 --> 00:31:51,159
I will never let you...

323
00:31:52,840 --> 00:31:55,919
...be like your father.
-Let go of my hat!

324
00:31:56,600 --> 00:31:58,519
Stop it now.

325
00:31:58,520 --> 00:32:01,639
Take it, you will learn to fight like a Mongol.

326
00:32:02,160 --> 00:32:03,759
It's yours now.

327
00:32:05,720 --> 00:32:07,039
Take it.

328
00:32:21,640 --> 00:32:25,399
Did you think I would become a
Mongol by giving me this sword?

329
00:32:25,960 --> 00:32:29,799
Don't think I'll not point this sword
at you because you are my uncle.

330
00:32:29,880 --> 00:32:32,639
You can point it, of course, you can.

331
00:32:33,160 --> 00:32:34,719
Just don't lose.

332
00:32:34,720 --> 00:32:37,799
If you are carrying my blood, you will not lose.

333
00:32:37,800 --> 00:32:39,879
I know what you are trying to do.

334
00:32:40,240 --> 00:32:42,519
You know I love swords.

335
00:32:42,520 --> 00:32:45,959
My father does not let me
have one because lama child.

336
00:32:46,680 --> 00:32:49,919
You will let me have one and
you will pull me to your side, huh?

337
00:32:51,760 --> 00:32:56,439
You really carry my blood. Really.

338
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:58,159
Stop it now.

339
00:32:58,200 --> 00:33:00,439
It's not about loving swords.

340
00:33:00,440 --> 00:33:03,159
Let's see if you have talent. Come on.

341
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:04,879
Allah is the Greatest!

342
00:33:15,840 --> 00:33:17,599
My lion...

343
00:33:23,760 --> 00:33:27,439
Who would have thought
we would be left with so few?

344
00:33:29,080 --> 00:33:33,199
Even if we are few, we
will make everything right.

345
00:33:34,200 --> 00:33:38,319
We will make the Mongols
and the Byzantines kneel.

346
00:33:39,080 --> 00:33:41,359
Yes brother, yes.

347
00:33:48,880 --> 00:33:50,679
Someone's there, brother.

348
00:33:58,120 --> 00:33:59,439
Saruca Bey.

349
00:34:03,400 --> 00:34:06,159
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

350
00:34:06,160 --> 00:34:08,149
What happened to you, brother?

351
00:34:09,120 --> 00:34:11,638
I am alright. I am alright, thanks to Allah.

352
00:34:11,639 --> 00:34:14,918
I have to see Osman Bey
immediately. I have things to tell him.

353
00:34:14,920 --> 00:34:17,478
Come on. -Come on.

354
00:34:29,679 --> 00:34:33,399
Holofira. Take this.

355
00:34:33,679 --> 00:34:36,239
Look, you are pregnant. You need to eat more.

356
00:34:36,239 --> 00:34:39,799
No, I'm full now. This is enough.

357
00:34:39,800 --> 00:34:42,638
Thank you, Gonca. -My Holofira.

358
00:34:42,880 --> 00:34:47,159
Look, Gonca is right. You eat
like a bird. You need to eat more.

359
00:34:47,159 --> 00:34:51,438
And our child, our child
shouldn't starve, right?

360
00:34:51,880 --> 00:34:52,998
Right...

361
00:34:53,600 --> 00:34:57,599
And if it takes after my brother
it will need twice as much.

362
00:34:58,920 --> 00:35:01,839
Look at him, my Bey. Look
at him, look at what he says.

363
00:35:01,840 --> 00:35:04,399
Everyone knows how hungry you are, Alaeddin.

364
00:35:04,400 --> 00:35:08,119
You're exaggerating, brother. When
did you ever see me eat that much?

365
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:18,679
May Allah grant both of us
to raise our children together.

366
00:35:18,880 --> 00:35:21,839
Aameen. -Aameen.

367
00:35:22,120 --> 00:35:25,559
May Allah let us be united and in peace forever.

368
00:35:25,680 --> 00:35:28,335
Together with our children,
and our grandchildren,

369
00:35:28,347 --> 00:35:30,857
...may we gather again at
such tables, God willing.

370
00:35:30,869 --> 00:35:32,599
God willing.

371
00:35:32,680 --> 00:35:35,759
You really started forgetting about me!

372
00:35:35,760 --> 00:35:39,759
You used to say I was the one who
made you happy around this table, father!

373
00:35:39,880 --> 00:35:41,879
But you grew up, my Fatma.

374
00:35:42,040 --> 00:35:44,679
You are becoming an aunt.
-Right, sister.

375
00:35:44,680 --> 00:35:48,159
Now you won't be jealous of
your niece/nephew, will you?

376
00:35:48,320 --> 00:35:49,599
No.

377
00:35:50,360 --> 00:35:53,879
My daughter will not grow up, right, Fatma?

378
00:36:32,360 --> 00:36:39,959
Give me your hand, give
me your hand, my daughter!

379
00:36:39,960 --> 00:36:42,279
Come on.

380
00:36:43,320 --> 00:36:43,999
My daughter...

381
00:36:45,720 --> 00:36:47,399
Walk.

382
00:36:47,480 --> 00:36:49,479
You are making me confused.

383
00:36:57,560 --> 00:36:58,759
Meryem.

384
00:37:00,040 --> 00:37:01,679
My daughter, are you alright?

385
00:37:01,680 --> 00:37:05,239
Are you full? Why did you leave?

386
00:37:05,240 --> 00:37:06,999
I have a headache...

387
00:37:08,760 --> 00:37:10,239
Come...

388
00:37:10,520 --> 00:37:13,919
What do you think to make
your head ache like that, huh?

389
00:37:13,920 --> 00:37:15,759
If it weren't for you...

390
00:37:16,200 --> 00:37:18,199
..I would have died.

391
00:37:19,720 --> 00:37:21,239
Osman Bey and...

392
00:37:21,880 --> 00:37:23,159
..you..

393
00:37:24,280 --> 00:37:26,959
..as if I was your own child...

394
00:37:27,600 --> 00:37:29,079
...you saved me.

395
00:37:30,680 --> 00:37:32,639
You are already our child.

396
00:37:32,720 --> 00:37:36,159
All the children of the
Kayi are our own, Meryem.

397
00:37:36,840 --> 00:37:39,359
Go, have some rest.

398
00:37:44,000 --> 00:37:45,079
My Bey...

399
00:37:54,800 --> 00:37:56,599
But I am not a Kayi.

400
00:37:58,320 --> 00:37:59,759
I am not Meryem.

401
00:38:01,120 --> 00:38:03,319
I am Poena.

402
00:38:03,320 --> 00:38:06,279
I will tell my aunt your location.

403
00:38:09,000 --> 00:38:10,959
My Bey...

404
00:38:11,080 --> 00:38:12,799
What happened? What is wrong?

405
00:38:15,840 --> 00:38:17,959
I am alright, thanks to Yusuf, my Bey.

406
00:38:18,200 --> 00:38:19,759
I owe my life to him.

407
00:38:21,840 --> 00:38:23,679
My Bey, I have things to tell you.

408
00:38:25,400 --> 00:38:27,359
Come on then, let's go into the tent.

409
00:38:29,840 --> 00:38:33,599
Put out the fires before evening.

410
00:38:44,720 --> 00:38:49,279
You say Yusuf isn't a traitor
like his sister, huh, Saruca?

411
00:38:51,200 --> 00:38:53,599
If he hadn't opened this wound in my chest

412
00:38:54,080 --> 00:38:57,959
...both Yusuf and I would be dead now, my Bey.

413
00:38:58,520 --> 00:39:00,799
"There is a wolf in the jackal's den now."

414
00:39:01,080 --> 00:39:03,439
"I'm at my Bey's service", he said.

415
00:39:03,880 --> 00:39:09,239
His sister is fork-tongued like a snake
but Yusuf is just the opposite, huh?

416
00:39:09,600 --> 00:39:12,017
May Allah be pleased with him.

417
00:39:12,029 --> 00:39:13,439
Aameen.
-Aameen.

418
00:39:14,240 --> 00:39:19,679
Do you think Ulugan and traitor
Ilbay will trust Yusuf's words?

419
00:39:19,760 --> 00:39:23,519
Maybe not in Kayi Tribe, but he has
influence in their own tribe, my Bey.

420
00:39:23,720 --> 00:39:26,183
Begum Hatun let Yusuf
take over the chair of

421
00:39:26,195 --> 00:39:28,999
Kecilisahs in return for
pledging loyalty to Ilbay.

422
00:39:29,120 --> 00:39:33,279
So... As they bowed against Mongolians earlier.

423
00:39:33,520 --> 00:39:37,999
...Tribe of Kecilisah isn't under
Mongolians' command anymore, you say

424
00:39:38,120 --> 00:39:39,519
That's right, my Bey.

425
00:39:39,760 --> 00:39:41,959
How will we make contact with Yusuf?

426
00:39:42,040 --> 00:39:43,639
Did you agree on a method?

427
00:39:43,760 --> 00:39:47,479
He'll check the hole of the huge
tree near Serinsu at times, my Bey.

428
00:39:47,800 --> 00:39:50,039
We'll place your orders there.

429
00:39:50,240 --> 00:39:51,679
God willing.

430
00:39:52,040 --> 00:39:56,079
Good. Good.

431
00:40:08,160 --> 00:40:11,119
I should send a message to my aunt to meet.

432
00:40:19,880 --> 00:40:24,039
I wish there were another
way but I have to do this.

433
00:40:25,000 --> 00:40:26,519
I will take revenge.

434
00:40:26,880 --> 00:40:30,199
You like Meryem, not Poena.

435
00:41:21,760 --> 00:41:22,559
-Boran.
-My Bey.

436
00:41:22,560 --> 00:41:25,599
Give this to Aykurt. He'll take
it where Saruca mentioned.

437
00:41:25,960 --> 00:41:30,639
-So Yusuf can follow my orders.
-Brother.

438
00:41:33,840 --> 00:41:35,639
I can deliver it, my Bey.

439
00:41:41,440 --> 00:41:45,319
What's your plan, my Bey? What
will Yusuf do in the tribe for us?

440
00:41:45,440 --> 00:41:50,319
As Tribe of Kecilisah isn't
under Mongolians' command

441
00:41:50,400 --> 00:41:58,559
...Yusuf will take his alps on our side
without drawing Ulugan and Ilbay's attention.

442
00:41:59,200 --> 00:42:04,679
This will be the first and most
important step of our resurrection move.

443
00:42:05,280 --> 00:42:09,639
It's important that the elders,
children and hatuns use swords.

444
00:42:10,560 --> 00:42:15,159
But what we really need
is strong and brave alps.

445
00:42:15,400 --> 00:42:17,399
Then what, my Bey?

446
00:42:18,600 --> 00:42:21,199
Let's say we found alps.

447
00:42:22,240 --> 00:42:25,359
What would alps need? Orhan, tell me.

448
00:42:25,560 --> 00:42:28,919
Swords, arrows, bows,
catapults, and flying flame.

449
00:42:29,080 --> 00:42:31,879
-They need any kind of weapons, my Bey.
-Yes.

450
00:42:32,080 --> 00:42:34,519
Our best swords were...

451
00:42:34,880 --> 00:42:39,239
...in the nearby outposts
that were protecting the tribe.

452
00:42:39,520 --> 00:42:41,919
Mongolian dogs seized them, my Bey.

453
00:42:42,040 --> 00:42:46,079
We won't only raid the outpost
and take our fine swords, Boran.

454
00:42:46,400 --> 00:42:51,639
But we'll also break Mongolian
resistance around the tribe.

455
00:42:52,280 --> 00:42:53,839
Alaaddin

456
00:42:53,920 --> 00:42:57,919
Let's say both alps and swords are provided.

457
00:43:00,040 --> 00:43:03,159
What else do we need?

458
00:43:03,360 --> 00:43:06,919
-We need intelligence, my Bey.
-Intelligence, yes.

459
00:43:07,400 --> 00:43:10,719
First, we should be awake.

460
00:43:10,960 --> 00:43:13,919
And but we need to put heathens to sleep.

461
00:43:14,760 --> 00:43:17,319
While alps collect information all around

462
00:43:18,080 --> 00:43:22,599
...they'll also spread wrong
information about our whereabouts.

463
00:43:24,520 --> 00:43:29,159
This duty belongs to Kanyumaz.

464
00:43:29,480 --> 00:43:30,959
Alaaddin.

465
00:43:31,960 --> 00:43:34,319
Inform him about his duty.

466
00:43:36,520 --> 00:43:38,159
Tell me, Bala.

467
00:43:38,960 --> 00:43:42,399
Do you have anything to
say? What else should we do?

468
00:43:43,640 --> 00:43:45,959
We should give Turks a hope, my Bey.

469
00:43:46,920 --> 00:43:50,608
Before anything else,
we need to place hopes in

470
00:43:50,620 --> 00:43:54,319
the hearts of beys and
people under our command.

471
00:43:54,840 --> 00:43:55,839
Right.

472
00:43:55,920 --> 00:43:59,919
Turks have solid hearts and unbreakable faith.

473
00:44:00,520 --> 00:44:02,919
We'll spread fear against heathens...

474
00:44:03,200 --> 00:44:07,439
...but faith and hope in
the hearts of our people.

475
00:44:07,680 --> 00:44:10,159
-God willing, my Bey.
-God willing.

476
00:44:23,400 --> 00:44:25,559
For my son, my Bey.

477
00:44:26,880 --> 00:44:28,679
For my son.

478
00:44:30,240 --> 00:44:32,399
I'm disobeying you.

479
00:44:33,400 --> 00:44:35,479
For my son.

480
00:44:44,320 --> 00:44:47,599
Deliver the note at any cost.

481
00:44:47,840 --> 00:44:49,879
I'll take Ghazi and be back.

482
00:44:50,920 --> 00:44:53,359
-Cerkutay Bey!
-Come on.

483
00:44:54,240 --> 00:44:55,999
Brother.

484
00:44:56,600 --> 00:45:00,359
Where did Cerkutay Bey go in the dark?

485
00:45:02,120 --> 00:45:03,239
Come on.

486
00:45:03,920 --> 00:45:05,239
Come on.

487
00:45:07,040 --> 00:45:10,319
First, we need to take the weapons.

488
00:45:10,400 --> 00:45:13,719
When we complete the preparations.

489
00:45:14,520 --> 00:45:17,399
...we will split up before the dawn.

490
00:45:17,840 --> 00:45:22,599
-And we'll raid all the outposts.
-As you order, my Bey.

491
00:45:23,040 --> 00:45:24,799
As you order, my Bey.

492
00:45:25,240 --> 00:45:27,959
-Do I have permission, my Bey?
-Come in!

493
00:45:29,480 --> 00:45:30,959
Peace be upon you.

494
00:45:31,320 --> 00:45:34,319
-Peace be upon you too.
- Peace be upon you too.

495
00:45:34,760 --> 00:45:38,559
-Didn't Cerkutay tell you about your duty?
-No, my Bey.

496
00:45:39,320 --> 00:45:41,439
I'm here about Cerkutay Bey.

497
00:45:41,760 --> 00:45:45,799
He rode off in the dark
without telling anyone anything.

498
00:45:46,520 --> 00:45:50,079
My Bey, he must have gone to the tribe.

499
00:45:50,360 --> 00:45:54,399
He'll both deliver the message to Yusuf and...
-And save Ghazi.

500
00:45:57,080 --> 00:45:59,279
He risked..

501
00:46:01,000 --> 00:46:03,639
...both his duty and his life, huh?

502
00:47:16,200 --> 00:47:17,519
Forgive me, my Bey.

503
00:47:18,280 --> 00:47:22,559
I need to save Ghazi, my precious
in this life, from those dastards.

504
00:47:23,560 --> 00:47:27,799
Every moment he is there, my
breath is tearing my lungs apart.

505
00:47:28,600 --> 00:47:30,719
It bleeds my heart.

506
00:48:04,760 --> 00:48:06,199
Meryem.

507
00:48:11,200 --> 00:48:15,759
-Why don't you sleep? -I couldn't.

508
00:48:16,960 --> 00:48:20,199
Rest a bit more. We have
much to do in the morning.

509
00:48:20,520 --> 00:48:22,999
You need to gain strength. Come on.

510
00:49:15,200 --> 00:49:16,959
Who is that?

511
00:49:19,040 --> 00:49:20,759
Cerkutay Bey.

512
00:49:24,600 --> 00:49:26,159
Cerkutay Bey.

513
00:49:26,400 --> 00:49:28,479
Thanks to Allah.

514
00:49:33,120 --> 00:49:35,679
-Yusuf Bey.
-My Bey.

515
00:49:37,960 --> 00:49:41,199
-Saruca told us what you said.
-That's right.

516
00:49:41,680 --> 00:49:43,599
I'm at Osman Bey's service.

517
00:49:44,160 --> 00:49:47,759
I say I'm at Osman Bey's
service. Don't you trust me?

518
00:49:54,680 --> 00:49:56,479
My Bey sent this.

519
00:49:56,560 --> 00:49:58,159
Okay.

520
00:49:58,480 --> 00:50:01,919
You should gather your
alps and make them join us.

521
00:50:02,080 --> 00:50:05,839
Alright. I'll gather the alps
quickly. Let my Bey know.

522
00:50:10,400 --> 00:50:12,079
My son.

523
00:50:14,560 --> 00:50:17,039
Have you seen Ghazi? Is he alright?

524
00:50:18,120 --> 00:50:20,679
He's fine. Don't worry.

525
00:50:21,720 --> 00:50:23,599
Altuga keeps him in his tent.

526
00:50:23,760 --> 00:50:25,999
He says he'll raise him as a Mongolian.

527
00:50:26,920 --> 00:50:29,799
He thinks he can take
revenge from me in this way.

528
00:50:31,520 --> 00:50:33,879
-I won't let that happen.
-Cerkutay Bey, wait.

529
00:50:34,720 --> 00:50:37,679
If they see you in the
tribe, they won't let you live.

530
00:50:38,000 --> 00:50:43,319
You will only deal with
the duty my Bey gave you!

531
00:50:43,360 --> 00:50:45,559
Cerkutay Bey, don't do this.

532
00:50:46,760 --> 00:50:49,199
You're our only spy left.

533
00:50:50,840 --> 00:50:54,999
If I get exposed,

534
00:50:57,120 --> 00:51:00,639
...don't do anything to risk your duty.

535
00:51:02,280 --> 00:51:04,239
Even if I die.

536
00:51:06,320 --> 00:51:08,039
This is my personal matter.

537
00:51:10,320 --> 00:51:13,159
-May Allah help you.
-May He help all of us.

538
00:51:14,760 --> 00:51:16,559
Go do your duty now.

539
00:51:52,600 --> 00:51:55,839
My Bey, they are too many.

540
00:51:57,640 --> 00:52:00,599
They protect the tribe from
that spot, my Shahzade.

541
00:52:00,600 --> 00:52:03,679
That's why all those dogs gathered here.

542
00:52:04,240 --> 00:52:07,079
What brings victory isn't numbers.

543
00:52:07,160 --> 00:52:11,919
It is bravery and mind.

544
00:52:14,960 --> 00:52:17,519
We will divide them now.

545
00:52:18,000 --> 00:52:21,359
-Aykurt is waiting for our call. Samil?
-My Bey.

546
00:52:22,360 --> 00:52:25,519
-Prepare the whistle arrow.
-As you order, my Bey.

547
00:52:25,760 --> 00:52:29,359
Come on, brothers! Make those dogs follow you.

548
00:52:34,800 --> 00:52:37,039
We're under attack!

549
00:52:41,040 --> 00:52:44,639
We're under attack! Catch them!

550
00:52:53,480 --> 00:52:57,439
-It's time to attack now.
-Come on, alps!

551
00:52:57,680 --> 00:52:59,439
Allah is the greatest!

552
00:53:02,080 --> 00:53:04,079
Allah is the greatest!

553
00:53:25,280 --> 00:53:29,879
Cerkutay will save Ghazi, right?

554
00:53:31,800 --> 00:53:33,399
God willing.

555
00:53:33,920 --> 00:53:35,759
God willing, Ulgen.

556
00:53:36,040 --> 00:53:39,639
But what Cerkutay Bey is doing isn't right.

557
00:53:43,840 --> 00:53:47,079
He made a mistake by disobeying Osman Bey.

558
00:53:47,400 --> 00:53:52,279
But they will back alive with Allah's will.

559
00:53:54,160 --> 00:53:55,999
God willing.

560
00:53:56,800 --> 00:53:58,839
I hope they come back alive.

561
00:53:59,120 --> 00:54:01,439
-He ask for forgiveness later.
-God willing.

562
00:54:02,520 --> 00:54:06,239
We're done. But you're still picking up herbs.

563
00:54:06,360 --> 00:54:09,399
Praise be to my beautiful girl. Let me see it.

564
00:54:10,880 --> 00:54:12,639
They are very nice.

565
00:54:13,120 --> 00:54:14,639
Praise be.

566
00:54:15,560 --> 00:54:18,119
Well... Where is Meryem?

567
00:54:19,080 --> 00:54:20,719
Meryem..

568
00:54:23,680 --> 00:54:25,599
She was picking up herbs with us.

569
00:54:26,120 --> 00:54:29,159
Didn't she come here?

570
00:54:30,200 --> 00:54:31,919
No, she didn't.

571
00:54:36,000 --> 00:54:37,399
Mother.

572
00:54:39,240 --> 00:54:42,039
Maybe, the kid got lost in the woods.

573
00:54:42,640 --> 00:54:43,839
Alps!

574
00:54:44,040 --> 00:54:47,599
Look for Meryem in the woods. Come on!

575
00:54:49,600 --> 00:54:52,039
I told her to stick with us.

576
00:54:52,520 --> 00:54:54,119
I hope she's not in trouble.

577
00:54:54,960 --> 00:54:58,039
God willing, she isn't. Let's go.

578
00:55:03,880 --> 00:55:05,399
Little bird.

579
00:55:06,640 --> 00:55:07,999
Aunt.

580
00:55:08,360 --> 00:55:11,879
Sending news with the innkeeper?

581
00:55:13,360 --> 00:55:16,559
Deliver this letter to Sofia carefully, alright?

582
00:55:16,840 --> 00:55:18,879
It's important.

583
00:55:28,680 --> 00:55:32,919
-A genius idea. You're very smart.
-Aunt.

584
00:55:33,960 --> 00:55:36,439
Thank God, you're alright.

585
00:55:38,520 --> 00:55:40,999
What if they notice your absence?

586
00:55:41,520 --> 00:55:43,759
We were picking up herbs in the woods.

587
00:55:44,000 --> 00:55:46,119
They think I got lost.

588
00:55:46,400 --> 00:55:48,639
You little demon.

589
00:55:49,360 --> 00:55:54,559
-Well... What other news?
There's a traitor among you, aunt.

590
00:55:55,680 --> 00:55:57,079
Yusuf.

591
00:56:00,440 --> 00:56:02,559
He's gathering alps for Osman.

592
00:56:04,360 --> 00:56:06,679
Damn it.

593
00:56:08,480 --> 00:56:11,679
I knew I shouldn't have trusted Turks.

594
00:56:12,360 --> 00:56:13,919
Alright.

595
00:56:14,840 --> 00:56:17,199
Where is Osman hiding now?

596
00:56:23,640 --> 00:56:26,639
In the forest behind Karain.

597
00:56:27,400 --> 00:56:30,079
Poena.

598
00:56:31,760 --> 00:56:35,279
Osman is going to die thanks to your help.

599
00:56:36,560 --> 00:56:38,999
Don't stay there, alright?

600
00:56:39,240 --> 00:56:41,079
Ulugan will let nobody live.

601
00:56:41,240 --> 00:56:43,959
Lukas doesn't let anyone live either, aunt.

602
00:56:44,360 --> 00:56:46,559
He almost killed me.

603
00:56:46,600 --> 00:56:48,879
-Lukas?
-Lukas.

604
00:56:51,000 --> 00:56:52,839
I will make him pay for this.

605
00:56:54,160 --> 00:56:57,959
Osman and Bala saved me right in time.

606
00:57:02,240 --> 00:57:04,399
What about your headaches?

607
00:57:05,680 --> 00:57:07,919
Can you sleep more easily now?

608
00:57:08,800 --> 00:57:10,119
No, aunt.

609
00:57:12,480 --> 00:57:14,399
I have nightmares again.

610
00:57:15,480 --> 00:57:18,039
Don't worry.

611
00:57:18,440 --> 00:57:20,399
I've brought your medicine.

612
00:57:21,240 --> 00:57:24,839
-What would I do without you, aunt?
-Take it.

613
00:57:31,680 --> 00:57:34,279
-Someone's coming.
-Meryem Hatun!

614
00:57:43,600 --> 00:57:48,359
Put swords, spears, flying flames
and everything else on the cart!

615
00:58:00,800 --> 00:58:02,759
Hay Praise be.

616
00:58:03,280 --> 00:58:07,799
My Bey, we will gain a victory
with these swords God willing.

617
00:58:08,960 --> 00:58:11,199
God willing.

618
00:58:11,200 --> 00:58:14,359
But our goal is not only to win the war.

619
00:58:14,360 --> 00:58:15,519
First..

620
00:58:15,840 --> 00:58:18,399
...it is to win Allah's mercy first.

621
00:58:19,040 --> 00:58:21,639
Infidelity will be ended for sure.

622
00:58:22,720 --> 00:58:25,239
Infidels will be destroyed.

623
00:58:25,600 --> 00:58:26,639
But...

624
00:58:27,080 --> 00:58:29,519
...we will not be the only ones to win.

625
00:58:30,720 --> 00:58:32,119
The one that wins...

626
00:58:32,760 --> 00:58:34,359
..will be Islam.

627
00:58:34,800 --> 00:58:37,279
God willing my Bey. -God willing.

628
00:58:39,600 --> 00:58:40,839
Come on.

629
00:58:40,840 --> 00:58:43,599
Get ready. We are leaving.
-Alps!

630
00:58:43,600 --> 00:58:45,479
Bring the horses, come on!

631
00:58:55,400 --> 00:58:57,159
Neither your nokers(Mongolian Soldiers)...

632
00:58:58,200 --> 00:59:00,199
...nor Byzantium's knights.

633
00:59:00,880 --> 00:59:04,319
None of them found a single trace of Osman.

634
00:59:06,040 --> 00:59:06,719
Your men..

635
00:59:06,720 --> 00:59:10,279
What is it, Ilbay Bey?

636
00:59:11,200 --> 00:59:14,599
Are you afraid because Osman
might come and take your throne?

637
00:59:14,880 --> 00:59:16,999
Know your limits, Lukas.

638
00:59:17,760 --> 00:59:20,799
Ilbay Bey is right about his concern.

639
00:59:22,040 --> 00:59:26,039
If Osman returns and sits on the throne...

640
00:59:26,200 --> 00:59:28,879
...he will be stronger than before.

641
00:59:29,400 --> 00:59:33,919
Then, we won't be the only
ones who will lose their heads.

642
00:59:44,240 --> 00:59:46,959
You are in my shadow, Hatun.

643
00:59:49,840 --> 00:59:52,399
Those who live under my shadow...

644
00:59:54,520 --> 00:59:57,199
...cannot be afraid of anyone but me.

645
01:00:02,680 --> 01:00:04,519
We cannot find Osman.

646
01:00:05,880 --> 01:00:07,919
He will come himself.

647
01:00:08,160 --> 01:00:09,679
How will that happen?

648
01:00:10,160 --> 01:00:12,399
I will hurt him badly.

649
01:00:13,440 --> 01:00:16,039
I will tear apart the homeland...

650
01:00:16,520 --> 01:00:18,879
...he holds dear, more than his own life.

651
01:00:21,920 --> 01:00:22,959
You..

652
01:00:25,400 --> 01:00:26,759
Lukas.

653
01:00:27,760 --> 01:00:33,999
You want to take back the castles
Osman took from the Byzantine, don't you?

654
01:00:34,480 --> 01:00:36,959
Right, Commander Ulugan.

655
01:00:44,360 --> 01:00:46,319
Choose three castles.

656
01:00:49,080 --> 01:00:50,719
Then inform us

657
01:00:51,960 --> 01:00:56,439
I will give you the castles
you chose and their people.

658
01:00:57,120 --> 01:00:59,039
You can turn them into slaves...

659
01:00:59,320 --> 01:01:00,759
..or sell them.

660
01:01:02,280 --> 01:01:04,119
You decide.

661
01:01:05,240 --> 01:01:08,279
How can I show my gratitude to you, Ulugan?

662
01:01:09,520 --> 01:01:11,439
You will pay a tax.

663
01:01:12,440 --> 01:01:14,279
A heavy tax.

664
01:01:15,840 --> 01:01:17,119
Sure.

665
01:01:17,560 --> 01:01:20,599
The land you gave to the
Byzantines is my property, Ulugan.

666
01:01:26,280 --> 01:01:27,599
You are..

667
01:01:27,640 --> 01:01:29,599
...under my rule as well.

668
01:01:37,160 --> 01:01:38,519
Your tent..

669
01:01:39,640 --> 01:01:40,999
...your tribe...

670
01:01:41,920 --> 01:01:43,999
..every breath you take...

671
01:01:44,920 --> 01:01:47,079
...is my gift to you.

672
01:01:47,600 --> 01:01:50,519
Don't forget whose door you serve at.

673
01:01:51,600 --> 01:01:52,799
Then..

674
01:01:53,280 --> 01:01:56,599
...your life and rule will be long.

675
01:02:08,240 --> 01:02:09,839
Osman will come here...

676
01:02:10,520 --> 01:02:12,479
...when he hears that...

677
01:02:13,320 --> 01:02:17,759
...land has been taken from his state...

678
01:02:19,800 --> 01:02:22,599
...and his people have become slaves again.

679
01:02:23,720 --> 01:02:28,679
And he will be at the end of our chains again.

680
01:03:53,680 --> 01:03:55,999
Red Devil.

681
01:04:01,920 --> 01:04:03,439
What's this hurry for, Hatun?

682
01:04:03,440 --> 01:04:06,719
I know where Osman is hiding.

683
01:04:14,320 --> 01:04:15,679
Nokers(Mongolian Soldiers)!

684
01:04:15,720 --> 01:04:18,879
Prepare the horses. We will go and hunt.

685
01:04:19,440 --> 01:04:21,359
They will attack.

686
01:04:22,880 --> 01:04:24,599
I need to inform my Bey.

687
01:04:27,560 --> 01:04:29,559
I will take Ghazi and then go.

688
01:04:30,000 --> 01:04:33,679
I will take Ghazi and then go.

689
01:04:43,760 --> 01:04:46,039
You..

690
01:04:47,480 --> 01:04:49,159
Cerkutay.

691
01:04:51,120 --> 01:04:53,439
You came to take your little dog, huh?

692
01:04:57,920 --> 01:05:00,599
Begum Hatun's brother Yusuf.

693
01:05:02,440 --> 01:05:03,959
He is a traitor.

694
01:05:06,640 --> 01:05:09,079
He fooled us all Ulugan.

695
01:05:09,080 --> 01:05:11,079
What are you saying, you infidel?

696
01:05:11,200 --> 01:05:13,359
Why do you slander my brother?

697
01:05:13,560 --> 01:05:17,319
Yusuf did not kill Saruca, Begum.

698
01:05:19,480 --> 01:05:21,479
He tricked us.

699
01:05:26,240 --> 01:05:27,919
Now their plan is...

700
01:05:30,000 --> 01:05:33,879
...to place the Kecilisah Alps
you gave to his command...

701
01:05:34,120 --> 01:05:36,999
...on Osman's side.

702
01:05:38,760 --> 01:05:40,519
Traitor...

703
01:05:41,720 --> 01:05:44,279
So his allegiance was not real.
-No.

704
01:05:44,680 --> 01:05:47,199
My brother would not betray me!
-Shut up!

705
01:05:48,600 --> 01:05:49,719
Hatun..

706
01:05:52,000 --> 01:05:53,279
Shut up..

707
01:05:56,360 --> 01:05:57,799
Shut up...

708
01:05:58,680 --> 01:06:02,039
...so you won't share the
same fate with your brother.

709
01:06:05,880 --> 01:06:07,839
Most importantly...

710
01:06:09,000 --> 01:06:14,639
...I found the place that Osman is hiding.

711
01:06:14,640 --> 01:06:16,439
Without wasting time..

712
01:06:18,120 --> 01:06:19,639
...we must attack.

713
01:06:21,720 --> 01:06:25,079
You couldn't have given
better news than this, Sofia.

714
01:06:30,280 --> 01:06:34,079
How did you find that out?

715
01:06:37,320 --> 01:06:39,319
You might be luring us into a trap.

716
01:06:42,320 --> 01:06:46,719
I told you I have a spy near Osman.

717
01:06:48,760 --> 01:06:50,519
The intelligence is correct.

718
01:06:51,720 --> 01:06:54,039
Let's set out.

719
01:07:02,920 --> 01:07:04,079
Now..

720
01:07:04,920 --> 01:07:08,319
...who will save you from my hands, Osman?

721
01:07:10,840 --> 01:07:12,359
We are leaving.

722
01:07:19,840 --> 01:07:21,039
Lukas..

723
01:07:22,880 --> 01:07:25,399
Thanks to my Poena who you tried to kill...

724
01:07:26,440 --> 01:07:30,559
...we found Osman.

725
01:07:33,680 --> 01:07:38,999
-Don't you ever...
I will not touch your precious daughter.

726
01:07:44,080 --> 01:07:46,799
But what if she remembers?

727
01:07:47,000 --> 01:07:49,039
It's not possible.

728
01:07:49,360 --> 01:07:53,639
The potion I gave her
took away all her memories.

729
01:08:05,840 --> 01:08:07,079
I will not leave my hat.

730
01:08:11,520 --> 01:08:15,999
Ghazi! Ghazi!

731
01:08:16,040 --> 01:08:21,959
Who are you? Father?
-Yes, your father! You are quite heavy handed.

732
01:08:21,960 --> 01:08:23,439
How did you come here?

733
01:08:23,439 --> 01:08:26,078
Ghazi, we are leaving!
Ghazi, we are leaving, come on!

734
01:08:26,080 --> 01:08:28,799
The demons are coming! -He went to his son.

735
01:08:28,800 --> 01:08:32,439
The demons are coming. Come on!

736
01:08:33,720 --> 01:08:34,959
This place.

737
01:08:38,960 --> 01:08:40,319
Come on.

738
01:08:40,319 --> 01:08:42,999
Come on!

739
01:08:46,200 --> 01:08:47,879
Come on father! Come on!

740
01:08:50,200 --> 01:08:53,198
Father! -Are you alright?
-I am alright!

741
01:08:53,200 --> 01:08:56,959
My lion, let's go!

742
01:09:03,520 --> 01:09:05,959
So you have come to my arms, huh, brother?

743
01:09:06,840 --> 01:09:09,719
You weren't this foolish when you were a Mongol.

744
01:09:11,600 --> 01:09:13,479
Your problem is with me.

745
01:09:14,880 --> 01:09:16,198
Not with my son.

746
01:09:16,520 --> 01:09:19,639
Aren't children the heirs
of their fathers, brother?

747
01:09:20,920 --> 01:09:25,319
Just as you betrayed your
father and your lineage..

748
01:09:26,200 --> 01:09:28,359
...Ghazi will do the same to you.

749
01:09:29,680 --> 01:09:31,118
My only concern is to...

750
01:09:31,200 --> 01:09:34,158
...make you experience what
you made others experience.

751
01:09:34,240 --> 01:09:38,238
I will never betray my Osman Bey or my father!

752
01:09:38,439 --> 01:09:40,679
Don't you even dream about that, uncle!

753
01:09:43,439 --> 01:09:45,479
I will take Ghazi out of the tribe.

754
01:09:46,240 --> 01:09:48,519
Then I will come and surrender.

755
01:09:49,200 --> 01:09:50,679
That's what I want.

756
01:09:51,399 --> 01:09:54,238
He is just a child. -That's better.

757
01:09:54,680 --> 01:09:58,279
He will meet the truth at a young age.

758
01:10:22,160 --> 01:10:24,359
Ghazi run! -Nokers(Mongolian Soldiers)!

759
01:10:45,440 --> 01:10:51,999
Father! Father!
Father! Let me go!

760
01:10:52,000 --> 01:10:53,559
Father!

761
01:10:58,360 --> 01:10:59,799
Let me go!

762
01:11:03,360 --> 01:11:05,959
Father! Father!

763
01:11:07,800 --> 01:11:12,039
Drop your sword, brother. Surrender.

764
01:11:13,200 --> 01:11:16,479
You don't want your child die before you.
-Let me go!

765
01:11:19,560 --> 01:11:20,479
Don't, father!

766
01:11:20,480 --> 01:11:22,839
Father, let me die! You must not die, father!

767
01:11:22,840 --> 01:11:25,079
Osman Bey needs you!

768
01:11:25,360 --> 01:11:27,199
Don't, father!

769
01:11:27,360 --> 01:11:29,559
Father, don't drop your swords!

770
01:11:29,600 --> 01:11:31,359
Don't! Run away!

771
01:11:35,440 --> 01:11:37,479
Father, what did you do?

772
01:11:40,520 --> 01:11:45,759
Father! Father!

773
01:11:49,320 --> 01:11:51,399
You are on the wrong way Altuga.

774
01:11:53,040 --> 01:11:54,639
You are on the wrong way.

775
01:11:58,120 --> 01:12:01,239
Spend the last moment with your child, brother.

776
01:12:02,160 --> 01:12:03,679
The last.

777
01:12:05,080 --> 01:12:06,399
Then..

778
01:12:07,080 --> 01:12:10,359
...you will see how I turn him into your enemy.

779
01:12:11,200 --> 01:12:13,559
I will kill you while you are alive.

780
01:12:14,280 --> 01:12:16,719
You won't die easily.

781
01:12:17,880 --> 01:12:20,919
You will regret that you didn't kill me!

782
01:12:23,720 --> 01:12:25,599
Even if you are my brother...

783
01:12:27,440 --> 01:12:30,399
...you will die the same
way Ulugan and his dogs die.

784
01:12:32,040 --> 01:12:34,959
I will cut you into pieces.

785
01:12:36,960 --> 01:12:38,159
I swear.

786
01:12:39,960 --> 01:12:41,199
Alright.

787
01:12:43,720 --> 01:12:45,159
Nokers(Mongolian Soldiers).

788
01:12:45,880 --> 01:12:48,879
Take these two to the caged tent, come on!

789
01:12:49,040 --> 01:12:55,439
No, no, father! Father! -I am with you my lion!

790
01:12:55,440 --> 01:12:57,999
Let us go!

791
01:13:04,200 --> 01:13:05,479
My Bey!

792
01:13:06,960 --> 01:13:08,319
My Bey!

793
01:13:08,320 --> 01:13:10,839
Are you going to tell me about Cerkutay?

794
01:13:11,160 --> 01:13:12,479
Yes my Bey.

795
01:13:13,200 --> 01:13:15,559
I know Cerkutay did something bad.

796
01:13:15,760 --> 01:13:19,839
But he did it to save his son, my Bey.
-Boran.

797
01:13:20,560 --> 01:13:23,319
Isn't his son our son?

798
01:13:23,480 --> 01:13:29,199
Didn't we say we are going to
save Ghazi when the time comes?

799
01:13:29,560 --> 01:13:30,959
This thing he did...

800
01:13:32,120 --> 01:13:35,279
This thing he did put
us into a difficult position.

801
01:13:35,560 --> 01:13:36,959
Cerkutay Bey...

802
01:13:37,200 --> 01:13:39,359
...Cerkutay Bey knows Mongols, my Bey.

803
01:13:39,360 --> 01:13:42,039
For sure they will come back safe and sound.

804
01:13:42,040 --> 01:13:43,799
I know, my son. I know.

805
01:13:44,560 --> 01:13:46,319
I trust him about that.

806
01:13:51,120 --> 01:13:53,359
Alaeddin. -My Bey.

807
01:13:57,040 --> 01:13:59,159
We now have enough ammunition.

808
01:14:01,480 --> 01:14:04,239
-So you succeeded, huh?
-Thanks to Allah, my Bey.

809
01:14:04,240 --> 01:14:07,759
We have pierced the heart of
the Mongol infidel with black steel.

810
01:14:07,800 --> 01:14:12,359
Thank you my son.
Come on valiants! Let's ride!

811
01:14:17,520 --> 01:14:19,519
Osman Bey Secret Tents

812
01:14:24,520 --> 01:14:27,719
I walked away to gather more herbs.

813
01:14:28,440 --> 01:14:29,879
Then I lost you.

814
01:14:29,920 --> 01:14:32,519
We were worried about you, my Meryem daughter.

815
01:14:32,560 --> 01:14:34,759
Look, Mongols are everywhere.

816
01:14:34,760 --> 01:14:37,119
Don't do it again it's dangerous.

817
01:14:37,280 --> 01:14:39,799
It won't happen again, Bala Hatun.

818
01:14:43,160 --> 01:14:44,919
My beautiful daughter.

819
01:14:44,920 --> 01:14:50,279
Let me see... Are you full now?

820
01:14:50,280 --> 01:14:52,559
You helped us in our hardest moment.

821
01:14:52,560 --> 01:14:56,079
If it weren't for you, my daughter
and I would be miserable.

822
01:15:05,800 --> 01:15:07,999
Come on now, go to your mother.

823
01:15:12,640 --> 01:15:15,159
Your daughter and you are...

824
01:15:15,320 --> 01:15:17,519
...the trust of our Allah.

825
01:15:18,160 --> 01:15:20,399
May Allah keep you together.

826
01:15:24,520 --> 01:15:26,639
You can stay here as long as you want.

827
01:15:26,640 --> 01:15:28,959
I appreciate, Bala Hatun.

828
01:15:29,040 --> 01:15:31,319
Sisters will show you where you will stay.

829
01:15:31,320 --> 01:15:33,119
Have some rest. Go.

830
01:15:39,880 --> 01:15:43,119
But they are infidels..
-My daughter...

831
01:15:43,480 --> 01:15:47,479
-Why are you helping them?
-They are human too.

832
01:15:47,480 --> 01:15:50,319
They are human, even if they are Christians.

833
01:15:50,520 --> 01:15:51,639
Right?

834
01:15:52,400 --> 01:15:53,399
But...

835
01:15:53,400 --> 01:15:54,599
Stop, my daughter.

836
01:15:54,600 --> 01:15:56,559
Come here.

837
01:16:02,320 --> 01:16:05,199
In the name of Allah, 
the merciful, the compassionate.

838
01:16:09,680 --> 01:16:11,999
In the name of Allah, 
the merciful, the compassionate.

839
01:16:13,040 --> 01:16:20,039
We learned mercy for every being from our
Prophet (PBUH), who is a mercy to the worlds.

840
01:16:24,640 --> 01:16:26,759
Look what I'll tell you.

841
01:16:28,720 --> 01:16:32,439
When our Rasulullah Efendi (PBUH)...

842
01:16:33,280 --> 01:16:35,559
...was sitting with his sahabas..

843
01:16:35,560 --> 01:16:38,799
...a non-Muslim funeral passed in front of them.

844
01:16:39,120 --> 01:16:43,559
And our Prophet stood up right away.
-Why?

845
01:16:44,960 --> 01:16:47,479
People of the Prophet asked, as you did.

846
01:16:47,480 --> 01:16:50,559
"Hey the Messenger of Allah,
he was a non-Muslim.

847
01:16:50,560 --> 01:16:52,719
Why are we standing up?"

848
01:16:53,480 --> 01:17:01,159
The Messenger of Allah said "Still, wasn't
he human?" and waited until the funeral passed...

849
01:17:02,000 --> 01:17:05,799
...showed respect, even if
the deceased was non-Muslim.

850
01:17:11,000 --> 01:17:13,239
But we are fighting.

851
01:17:13,520 --> 01:17:16,039
Aren't we in this state because of them now?

852
01:17:16,040 --> 01:17:18,439
These are two different things, my daughter.

853
01:17:18,440 --> 01:17:21,610
We draw our sword against
those who show hostility

854
01:17:21,622 --> 01:17:24,679
to us, who attacks us,
our wealth, and our faith.

855
01:17:24,720 --> 01:17:29,679
Otherwise, we do not oppress anyone, regardless
of their language, religion, or race.

856
01:17:31,040 --> 01:17:37,999
Especially children, women, and
the oppressed are valuable for us.

857
01:17:40,480 --> 01:17:45,799
There are times when no sword
can defeat the power of mercy.

858
01:17:47,600 --> 01:17:50,239
Do not forget this, alright, my daughter?

859
01:17:54,560 --> 01:17:55,599
Come on.

860
01:18:05,840 --> 01:18:10,679
Thanks to Allah! Osman Bey, welcome!

861
01:18:11,800 --> 01:18:13,599
Thanks to Allah, Osman Bey!

862
01:18:15,320 --> 01:18:18,159
Welcome! -Thank you. Thank you!

863
01:18:18,920 --> 01:18:22,119
Thank you.

864
01:18:27,400 --> 01:18:29,079
O people!

865
01:18:30,280 --> 01:18:33,599
Our swords, which are the
hope of resurrection, have arrived.

866
01:18:34,200 --> 01:18:36,999
Come on. Aykurt. -My Bey!

867
01:18:37,000 --> 01:18:40,559
-Take these somewhere safe.
-As you order, my Bey.

868
01:18:40,560 --> 01:18:41,599
Come on!

869
01:19:02,920 --> 01:19:04,719
Bala. -My Bey...

870
01:19:11,000 --> 01:19:12,199
Mother...

871
01:19:14,120 --> 01:19:16,599
Mother, what are you doing?

872
01:19:17,000 --> 01:19:22,359
What are you doing? Stop. Why are you
carrying this when there are so many men here?

873
01:19:23,000 --> 01:19:24,479
Take this.

874
01:19:26,440 --> 01:19:31,568
What is carrying this
burden for this state? We

875
01:19:31,580 --> 01:19:36,399
would even give our
lives holding our swords.

876
01:19:36,400 --> 01:19:37,839
My Osman Bey.

877
01:19:42,000 --> 01:19:43,799
Mother..

878
01:19:48,400 --> 01:19:51,839
This state is strong thanks to you.

879
01:19:54,080 --> 01:19:56,839
Thanks to the valiants who run after me...

880
01:19:56,960 --> 01:20:02,479
...and to mothers who
gave birth to those valiants!

881
01:20:03,360 --> 01:20:04,879
Thank you mother.

882
01:20:05,240 --> 01:20:07,679
Nothing will happen to this state, for sure.

883
01:20:14,200 --> 01:20:17,581
We are a nation that
doesn't hesitate to sacrifice

884
01:20:17,593 --> 01:20:20,719
anything, to be free,
and to be strong, my Bey.

885
01:20:21,480 --> 01:20:26,399
The oppression of the infidels will not be
able to defeat the efforts of these mothers.

886
01:20:29,600 --> 01:20:31,519
Yes, my Bala.

887
01:20:31,600 --> 01:20:38,277
We will rise with our teeth, our nails,
our blood, and our lives, for sure.

888
01:20:38,289 --> 01:20:40,519
God willing!

889
01:20:40,520 --> 01:20:44,279
And together, we will grow the
fire of resurrection, God willing.

890
01:20:44,280 --> 01:20:45,599
God willing my Bey!

891
01:20:47,120 --> 01:20:56,159
Allah is the Greatest!

892
01:20:56,160 --> 01:20:57,639
Begum Hatun Tents

893
01:20:58,370 --> 01:21:00,009
My Alps!

894
01:21:00,720 --> 01:21:02,879
My Beys, my valiants!

895
01:21:02,960 --> 01:21:04,599
Tell me!

896
01:21:05,360 --> 01:21:07,959
What does an Alp live for?

897
01:21:07,960 --> 01:21:10,879
-Why does he fight with his sword?
-For the truth!

898
01:21:10,880 --> 01:21:11,919
For war!

899
01:21:11,920 --> 01:21:13,879
For customs!

900
01:21:15,240 --> 01:21:16,599
Tell me!

901
01:21:16,640 --> 01:21:20,079
Is this the right way? Are we going to...

902
01:21:20,320 --> 01:21:22,879
...work with traitors and those who are sold?

903
01:21:22,960 --> 01:21:26,999
Will we unite with those who declare
war on the da'wah of Almighty Allah?

904
01:21:27,520 --> 01:21:29,639
Does this suit an Alp?

905
01:21:31,720 --> 01:21:32,959
My Alps...

906
01:21:33,720 --> 01:21:35,079
My valiants...

907
01:21:35,320 --> 01:21:38,594
Will you ally with those
who sell the Hereafter in this world...

908
01:21:38,606 --> 01:21:41,599
....a world we cannot
even control for a moment?

909
01:21:41,600 --> 01:21:44,559
Will we remain silent and
be like the mute devils?

910
01:21:44,760 --> 01:21:48,288
Or will we unite with Osman
Bey, who rebels against the tyranny...

911
01:21:48,300 --> 01:21:51,839
...and bring this
treacherous sultanate to an end?

912
01:21:53,400 --> 01:21:54,759
Tell me!

913
01:21:55,360 --> 01:21:57,839
-Are you with me?
-We are with you!

914
01:21:57,840 --> 01:22:04,479
Allah is the Greatest!

915
01:22:12,640 --> 01:22:16,959
This is the best day to rebel
against the cruel! Attack!

916
01:22:18,200 --> 01:22:20,839
Burn down their tribe!

917
01:22:30,840 --> 01:22:33,679
Show mercy for nobody!

918
01:22:39,960 --> 01:22:42,839
You will pay for this, Lukas!

919
01:22:43,720 --> 01:22:46,839
By taking Osman's side, you chose death!

920
01:23:01,400 --> 01:23:03,839
You're all alone, Yusuf!

921
01:23:04,080 --> 01:23:07,439
Don't fight in vain.
Nobody is going to help you!

922
01:23:09,280 --> 01:23:13,359
The tribe of Osman you trust
so much will be all destroyed!

923
01:23:21,120 --> 01:23:23,119
Near Osman Bey Secret Tents

924
01:23:25,480 --> 01:23:29,599
Burn down everything and
leave no heads over shoulders.

925
01:23:29,800 --> 01:23:35,839
Osman, his people and family shouldn't survive.

926
01:23:36,120 --> 01:23:38,079
As you order. Commander Ulugan.

927
01:23:38,920 --> 01:23:40,639
But Olcaytu Khan...

928
01:23:41,920 --> 01:23:43,399
Olcaytu...

929
01:23:44,560 --> 01:23:47,839
...will get the news that
Byzantine killed Osman.

930
01:23:48,720 --> 01:23:53,999
Let's bury Osman, his family
and everyone in the pit of hell.

931
01:23:54,120 --> 01:23:56,359
-Here we go.
-Nokers(Mongolian Soldiers).

932
01:24:01,440 --> 01:24:03,159
Ilbay.

933
01:24:05,160 --> 01:24:07,959
I don't want my brother to die like this.

934
01:24:08,680 --> 01:24:10,999
His betrayal has been exposed, Begum.

935
01:24:12,080 --> 01:24:15,679
If we stand with him,
Ulugan won't let us live either.

936
01:24:18,520 --> 01:24:20,919
It's only you and me now.

937
01:24:23,560 --> 01:24:25,239
You should know this.

938
01:24:25,520 --> 01:24:27,159
I will never leave you.

939
01:24:27,800 --> 01:24:29,319
Come on.

940
01:24:31,080 --> 01:24:36,479
Your alps and people are
going to die because of you!

941
01:24:36,760 --> 01:24:42,799
They're going to die for their cause and
homeland instead of dying as traitors at least!

942
01:24:42,960 --> 01:24:45,119
For nothing.

943
01:24:59,680 --> 01:25:03,599
I would kill me if I were you, Lukas.

944
01:25:06,360 --> 01:25:09,239
Who do you think you are?

945
01:25:10,240 --> 01:25:16,119
You're a loser pretending to be
a bey under his sister's shadow.

946
01:25:16,560 --> 01:25:18,759
What are you talking about?

947
01:25:21,040 --> 01:25:22,679
-Get off!
-Hristo!

948
01:25:23,120 --> 01:25:25,479
-Don't kill him.
-As you order. Commander.

949
01:25:25,680 --> 01:25:27,079
Don't kill the survivors.

950
01:25:27,280 --> 01:25:29,239
You'll wait for your turn, Yusuf.

951
01:25:29,600 --> 01:25:31,479
But I'll give you that.

952
01:25:31,600 --> 01:25:34,839
You will be very useful though you're a loser.

953
01:25:35,000 --> 01:25:39,519
Whatever your goal is, you
won't be able to succeed!

954
01:25:39,600 --> 01:25:40,959
Get off!

955
01:25:45,840 --> 01:25:48,079
I'm not taking your filthy life...

956
01:25:48,160 --> 01:25:52,559
...so you will be a lesson for
Osman's rebellious Beys and people.

957
01:25:52,720 --> 01:25:57,359
Who do you think you are? Huh?

958
01:26:00,600 --> 01:26:01,479
In the arena.

959
01:26:02,880 --> 01:26:07,639
...you and your alps are going
to die in front of all people!

960
01:26:08,440 --> 01:26:10,399
And everybody...

961
01:26:11,240 --> 01:26:13,759
...will see Lukas' power...

962
01:26:14,480 --> 01:26:17,919
...and that Kayi is done.

963
01:26:20,840 --> 01:26:23,599
You think you can get away with this?

964
01:26:25,080 --> 01:26:27,119
You dogs.

965
01:26:33,720 --> 01:26:36,439
We've been dreaming of this day, Sofia.

966
01:26:37,280 --> 01:26:41,799
Now it will be as we always desired.

967
01:26:53,320 --> 01:26:56,679
-Look everywhere!
-Come on!

968
01:27:00,360 --> 01:27:04,479
Osman... Where have you gone, Osman?

969
01:27:08,760 --> 01:27:10,267
Altuga, what's going on?

970
01:27:10,279 --> 01:27:13,559
There's nobody left in the
tribe. Commander Ulugan.

971
01:27:19,600 --> 01:27:23,039
-They're all here, my Bey.
-Let them come.

972
01:27:23,920 --> 01:27:26,959
-They're coming to their death.
-Vile dogs.

973
01:27:30,520 --> 01:27:32,679
It seems Osman knew we were coming.

974
01:27:32,880 --> 01:27:36,879
Sofia's spy betrayed

975
01:27:38,720 --> 01:27:43,199
-They must have left some trails. Search!
-Nokers(Mongolian Soldiers)!

976
01:27:50,840 --> 01:27:53,559
Alaaddin, you will shoot first.

977
01:28:08,880 --> 01:28:10,959
Trap

978
01:28:12,280 --> 01:28:14,399
-Now.
-This is a trap!

979
01:28:41,640 --> 01:28:43,799
Praise be.

980
01:28:48,160 --> 01:28:50,199
Nokers(Mongolian Soldiers) are coming, my Bey.

981
01:28:50,880 --> 01:28:52,759
Here we go.

982
01:28:53,000 --> 01:28:57,239
They'll be here shortly. Let's join the hatuns.

983
01:28:58,000 --> 01:28:59,599
Come on.

984
01:29:02,640 --> 01:29:03,959
Meryem.

985
01:29:04,720 --> 01:29:06,639
We're lucky, you noticed them.

986
01:29:06,760 --> 01:29:09,279
Or it would have been a disaster for us.

987
01:29:13,160 --> 01:29:15,039
What have I done?

988
01:29:15,320 --> 01:29:17,359
If Mongolians come

989
01:29:17,800 --> 01:29:20,079
...they will kill everyone again.

990
01:29:22,480 --> 01:29:24,239
Everyone.

991
01:29:31,880 --> 01:29:33,879
What are you doing, mother?

992
01:29:33,920 --> 01:29:36,759
-Give it to me.
-Thank you.

993
01:29:36,920 --> 01:29:40,719
-Bala Hatun. Bala Hatun.
-Yes, dear?

994
01:29:41,600 --> 01:29:45,039
What's the matter?
You look pale.

995
01:29:46,400 --> 01:29:49,597
I was going to tell you
something but I'm afraid.

996
01:29:49,609 --> 01:29:50,679
Tell me.

997
01:29:52,560 --> 01:29:54,359
I'm not sure, but...

998
01:29:54,640 --> 01:29:57,759
...I felt like someone was
behind me when I got lost.

999
01:30:01,240 --> 01:30:03,359
Mongolians may have seen me.

1000
01:30:07,320 --> 01:30:09,439
What if they find us?

1001
01:30:10,680 --> 01:30:13,039
I should inform Osman Bey quickly.

1002
01:30:15,360 --> 01:30:16,759
Aunt...

1003
01:30:17,320 --> 01:30:19,479
Forgive me.

1004
01:30:28,360 --> 01:30:30,119
-Holofira.
-Sister-in-law.

1005
01:30:30,600 --> 01:30:32,319
Are you alright?

1006
01:30:33,920 --> 01:30:35,359
My girl?

1007
01:30:36,320 --> 01:30:39,719
I'm fine. I just felt some pain there.

1008
01:30:40,080 --> 01:30:41,599
I'm good now.

1009
01:30:41,640 --> 01:30:43,279
You ran. It must be why.

1010
01:30:43,360 --> 01:30:46,119
Bring a chair! You should sit down.

1011
01:30:46,840 --> 01:30:48,559
Osman Bey's coming.

1012
01:30:50,120 --> 01:30:52,319
-Is everyone alright?
-My girl...

1013
01:30:52,600 --> 01:30:54,639
-My Bey.
-Holofira, my dear.

1014
01:30:56,760 --> 01:30:59,439
Holofira... What happened, mother?

1015
01:30:59,840 --> 01:31:02,599
-Are you alright?
-I'm fine now. Don't worry.

1016
01:31:02,680 --> 01:31:06,759
She's fine. She just felt
some pain when she ran.

1017
01:31:06,960 --> 01:31:09,279
â€œAre you alright?
-I'm good.

1018
01:31:14,920 --> 01:31:16,719
What about Mongolians, my Bey?

1019
01:31:18,600 --> 01:31:21,639
My girl, thanks to your carefulness,

1020
01:31:21,760 --> 01:31:24,719
...we've got rid of Mongolians
for now. Thank you.

1021
01:31:26,400 --> 01:31:28,039
What now, father?

1022
01:31:28,120 --> 01:31:31,399
We'll find somewhere to stay now.

1023
01:31:31,480 --> 01:31:34,399
But we won't worry and give up.

1024
01:31:34,640 --> 01:31:36,679
We showed them our fist.

1025
01:31:36,680 --> 01:31:40,279
Now we'll get more powerful and be back.

1026
01:31:44,400 --> 01:31:48,119
They must have started tracking,
father. We should get away.

1027
01:31:48,560 --> 01:31:51,799
Come on, pack up your things. Come on, Holofira.

1028
01:31:51,840 --> 01:31:54,319
-Alright. Let's go, girl.
-Come on.

1029
01:31:55,080 --> 01:31:57,439
Come to me. Let's go.

1030
01:31:57,520 --> 01:31:59,359
People, get up. Time to go.

1031
01:31:59,360 --> 01:32:02,999
-Here we go.
-Come here, girl.

1032
01:32:11,200 --> 01:32:13,119
Begum Hatun.

1033
01:32:25,920 --> 01:32:29,079
-Ilbay.
Begum Hatun. Begum Hatun.

1034
01:32:34,240 --> 01:32:37,159
Begum Hatun! Begum Hatun!

1035
01:32:37,520 --> 01:32:39,439
Are you alright?
-My arm...

1036
01:32:40,480 --> 01:32:42,759
I can't move my arm.

1037
01:32:48,800 --> 01:32:52,599
Don't worry. I'll take you to a healer.

1038
01:33:05,680 --> 01:33:09,759
We'd be dead if you hadn't
noticed. You saved us all.

1039
01:33:14,360 --> 01:33:16,759
I swear..

1040
01:33:17,120 --> 01:33:18,919
Osman.

1041
01:33:19,240 --> 01:33:22,839
I swear I will skin you!

1042
01:33:26,720 --> 01:33:29,199
I swear!

1043
01:33:29,320 --> 01:33:32,239
Nobody in your family will survive!

1044
01:33:37,040 --> 01:33:39,359
May high beech trees be my witness!

1045
01:33:40,000 --> 01:33:42,839
I swear on my ancestor Genghis...

1046
01:33:43,080 --> 01:33:47,239
I swear I won't stop before I kill you!

1047
01:33:47,400 --> 01:33:52,279
I swear!

1048
01:33:54,320 --> 01:33:58,279
Osman Bey Secret Tents

1049
01:33:59,560 --> 01:34:02,919
Come on, man. Do it properly.

1050
01:34:04,720 --> 01:34:06,999
Come on, brothers.

1051
01:34:07,960 --> 01:34:09,519
Carry the chests.

1052
01:34:09,840 --> 01:34:12,799
We should secure the weapons first.

1053
01:34:15,320 --> 01:34:18,159
This place won't be exposed, God willing, my Bey.

1054
01:34:18,440 --> 01:34:20,559
It won't be, Bala.

1055
01:34:20,680 --> 01:34:24,039
Warn Meryem and all people, though.

1056
01:34:24,360 --> 01:34:27,959
The enemy are watching
us. So we need to be careful.

1057
01:34:28,280 --> 01:34:32,119
Nobody will leave the
tribe without my knowledge.

1058
01:34:39,320 --> 01:34:41,159
Orhan. Alps.

1059
01:34:46,720 --> 01:34:49,839
-My Bey.
-Kanyumaz.

1060
01:34:53,800 --> 01:34:55,919
Kanyumaz?

1061
01:34:56,280 --> 01:34:59,119
What? Important news?

1062
01:34:59,240 --> 01:35:00,959
Yes, my Bey.

1063
01:35:01,160 --> 01:35:05,079
The intelligence we've collect...
The news isn't good at all.

1064
01:35:08,880 --> 01:35:10,919
Cerkutay Bey...

1065
01:35:12,640 --> 01:35:13,948
Yes?

1066
01:35:13,960 --> 01:35:17,919
He got caught when he tried
to save his son Ghazi, my Bey.

1067
01:35:18,960 --> 01:35:22,399
They're keeping in a cage tent in the tribe now.

1068
01:35:28,320 --> 01:35:30,879
What are you saying, Kanyumaz?

1069
01:35:33,880 --> 01:35:36,159
First my son and now my husband...

1070
01:35:36,400 --> 01:35:39,719
-My Allah, help me...
-Ulgen, stand strong.

1071
01:35:39,840 --> 01:35:41,279
They'll be alright.

1072
01:35:41,440 --> 01:35:44,039
We'll save both Cerkutay and Ghazi.

1073
01:35:44,200 --> 01:35:46,439
Help me, my Allah.

1074
01:35:53,200 --> 01:35:55,559
You obviously important news.

1075
01:35:55,640 --> 01:35:58,639
-Follow me, Kanyumaz.
-As you order, my Bey.

1076
01:36:21,760 --> 01:36:26,999
-What are you doing, Ulugan?
-You sent me to death.

1077
01:36:27,720 --> 01:36:30,879
My nokers(Mongolian Soldiers) died.

1078
01:36:34,280 --> 01:36:37,519
Your spy betrayed us.

1079
01:36:48,200 --> 01:36:50,399
What are you talking about?

1080
01:36:50,440 --> 01:36:52,799
There was nobody when we reached the tribe.

1081
01:36:53,080 --> 01:36:55,999
They knew we were going there.
-No.

1082
01:36:57,240 --> 01:36:59,199
She would never tell.

1083
01:37:01,920 --> 01:37:05,679
Ulugan, she would never do that.

1084
01:37:06,920 --> 01:37:09,519
Are you sure you didn't get followed?

1085
01:37:09,920 --> 01:37:12,599
How do you know our spy betrayed you?

1086
01:37:13,160 --> 01:37:15,239
Osman's spies are everywhere.

1087
01:37:19,440 --> 01:37:24,359
Commander Ulugan, they raided
the outpost protecting the tribe.

1088
01:37:25,320 --> 01:37:28,959
Kayi people attacked and
collected all the weapons.

1089
01:37:36,720 --> 01:37:40,319
I broke Osman's wings.

1090
01:37:40,840 --> 01:37:42,439
But it didn't work!

1091
01:37:50,040 --> 01:37:52,079
I burned his tent.

1092
01:37:54,920 --> 01:37:56,279
It didn't work.

1093
01:38:00,520 --> 01:38:05,239
He's still rising against
me with just a few raiders.

1094
01:38:09,040 --> 01:38:10,919
Well..

1095
01:38:11,800 --> 01:38:15,719
I arrested your treacherous
brother, Begum Hatun.

1096
01:38:17,280 --> 01:38:22,159
Tomorrow, in the arena, we're
going to kill Yusuf and his alps...

1097
01:38:22,400 --> 01:38:27,799
...in front of Osman's Beys and
people to make an example for everyone!

1098
01:38:30,520 --> 01:38:34,239
From now on, everybody will know...

1099
01:38:35,080 --> 01:38:40,999
Whoever stands with Osman is going to die!

1100
01:38:50,400 --> 01:38:57,799
It will be a massacre.
We'll destroy Osman's ideal.

1101
01:38:58,960 --> 01:39:01,879
It will be a huge massacre.

1102
01:39:05,840 --> 01:39:09,279
Kanyumaz, what's the situation?

1103
01:39:09,520 --> 01:39:12,279
I don't like saying this, my Bey, but...

1104
01:39:12,400 --> 01:39:19,359
...Ulugan will give three castles in our
land to Byzantine which Lukas will choose.

1105
01:39:26,080 --> 01:39:29,079
They're trying to eat our
flesh like vultures, huh?

1106
01:39:30,320 --> 01:39:33,359
What about the traitor called Ilbay, my Bey?

1107
01:39:33,720 --> 01:39:38,039
He says he's the bey of
Kayi but kneels before them!

1108
01:39:38,280 --> 01:39:43,919
Well... I have things to tell him as well.

1109
01:39:44,800 --> 01:39:48,839
But lion's meat tastes bitter.

1110
01:39:49,120 --> 01:39:52,439
It won't bu hunted by jackals easily.

1111
01:39:52,840 --> 01:39:55,079
We will show them.

1112
01:39:58,080 --> 01:40:01,679
My Bey, I also have news about Yusuf Bey.

1113
01:40:02,520 --> 01:40:06,879
Yusuf Bey and alps of Kecilisah
who intended to join us...

1114
01:40:07,160 --> 01:40:10,359
..got attacked by Lukas and Sofia.

1115
01:40:11,760 --> 01:40:15,559
What are you saying, Kanyumaz?
How did they know about our plan?

1116
01:40:21,080 --> 01:40:23,759
Whenever we take a step.

1117
01:40:24,920 --> 01:40:27,279
...they always know about it.

1118
01:40:29,200 --> 01:40:33,519
Obviously, there is a spy among us.

1119
01:40:34,080 --> 01:40:38,199
But all the people here suffered
from Mongolians, my Bey.

1120
01:40:38,440 --> 01:40:41,119
Who would spy for Ulugan and why?

1121
01:40:41,720 --> 01:40:45,759
When I find out, I will cut
off his head personally.

1122
01:40:49,600 --> 01:40:53,239
Tell me, Kanyumaz. Where are
they keeping Yusuf and the alps?

1123
01:40:53,640 --> 01:40:57,519
My Shahzade, Lukas has sent them to the arena.

1124
01:40:59,640 --> 01:41:06,039
They're going to be executed before Turkish
and Roman people and our Beys tomorrow.

1125
01:41:16,120 --> 01:41:18,679
I know what they intend to do.

1126
01:41:19,280 --> 01:41:21,839
They want to spread terror in hearts.

1127
01:41:22,040 --> 01:41:24,839
They want to extinguish our resurrection fire.

1128
01:41:25,240 --> 01:41:27,279
But don't worry.

1129
01:41:27,680 --> 01:41:30,119
We won't let that happen.

1130
01:41:33,720 --> 01:41:35,439
Thanks to Allah.

1131
01:41:35,920 --> 01:41:37,639
Osman Bey is saved.

1132
01:41:37,720 --> 01:41:40,279
He didn't get tricked by those snakes.

1133
01:41:43,120 --> 01:41:44,679
Father.

1134
01:41:45,240 --> 01:41:50,839
We will survive too, right?
-Ghazi, my son... We will.

1135
01:41:51,640 --> 01:41:53,679
For sure, we will survive.

1136
01:41:54,440 --> 01:41:56,119
We always do.

1137
01:41:56,640 --> 01:41:58,639
You're right.

1138
01:41:59,920 --> 01:42:06,479
Look at me. What Altuga said
didn't discourage you, right?

1139
01:42:06,520 --> 01:42:07,839
Of course not!

1140
01:42:08,120 --> 01:42:11,319
I'm the son of Double-Sworded Cerkutay Bey!

1141
01:42:13,640 --> 01:42:16,599
Praise be to my boy!

1142
01:42:20,960 --> 01:42:25,079
You're truly Cerkutay Bey's son.

1143
01:42:26,200 --> 01:42:28,359
Okay, but...

1144
01:42:29,200 --> 01:42:32,039
I haven't eaten anything for days.

1145
01:42:32,480 --> 01:42:35,319
Just be patient, my boy.

1146
01:42:35,440 --> 01:42:38,839
We will eat soon. Your father
will get a feast prepared for you.

1147
01:42:38,840 --> 01:42:41,119
I'll tell your mother to prepare a long table.

1148
01:42:41,120 --> 01:42:43,919
A day long with a horse!
You will sit alone there.

1149
01:42:44,000 --> 01:42:46,959
And me of course. We
will join in the middle and...

1150
01:42:50,880 --> 01:42:55,159
I'm not a cruel man who
would make his nephew starve.

1151
01:42:59,000 --> 01:42:59,679
Come.

1152
01:43:20,840 --> 01:43:22,959
Their meat is not like ours.

1153
01:43:25,880 --> 01:43:31,479
Your uncle forgot his humanity
from eating pork, my son.

1154
01:43:34,560 --> 01:43:36,839
We don't want your food.

1155
01:43:37,760 --> 01:43:39,199
We don't want it.

1156
01:43:41,160 --> 01:43:44,679
Ghazi will eat like a Mongol.

1157
01:43:45,360 --> 01:43:46,839
He will become a Mongol.

1158
01:43:47,760 --> 01:43:51,879
He will not be a traitor a Muslim dog like you.

1159
01:43:55,880 --> 01:44:00,519
A Muslim never eats pork! Never!

1160
01:44:01,240 --> 01:44:03,519
Even if I die of hunger, I won't eat it.

1161
01:44:03,840 --> 01:44:05,199
Never!

1162
01:44:12,600 --> 01:44:14,719
Did you get your answer?

1163
01:44:21,960 --> 01:44:24,639
As you wish, Ghazi noker(Mongolian soldier).

1164
01:44:24,640 --> 01:44:26,479
I am not a noker!

1165
01:44:26,480 --> 01:44:28,839
Let's see how long you can resist.

1166
01:44:30,760 --> 01:44:32,199
I am not!

1167
01:44:41,920 --> 01:44:45,879
My lion. My valiant.

1168
01:44:46,400 --> 01:44:50,879
You gave him the answer he deserved! My valiant!

1169
01:44:56,720 --> 01:44:57,999
Ghazi.

1170
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:03,679
-Do you want to wrestle?
-Yes.

1171
01:45:07,560 --> 01:45:09,559
Allah!

1172
01:45:09,560 --> 01:45:13,679
-I won!
-No, you didn't. You didn't win.

1173
01:45:24,400 --> 01:45:25,479
My Bala..

1174
01:45:26,680 --> 01:45:28,999
Because of the spy among us...

1175
01:45:29,760 --> 01:45:33,679
...no one except the Beys
and Shahzades will go outside.

1176
01:45:33,760 --> 01:45:35,759
Don't worry, my Osman.

1177
01:45:37,280 --> 01:45:42,679
You say there's no choice but to go to the
arena to light the fire of resurrection, huh?

1178
01:45:43,440 --> 01:45:45,039
Yusuf and the Alps...

1179
01:45:46,000 --> 01:45:47,959
I will never leave them there.

1180
01:45:47,960 --> 01:45:54,439
I know, my Osman, but Ulugan, Lukas,
Sofia... all are waiting to hunt you...

1181
01:45:54,440 --> 01:45:57,439
...but you still want to go, huh?
-Look my Bala.

1182
01:45:58,280 --> 01:46:02,839
Land can be lost. Lives can be lost. But...

1183
01:46:02,920 --> 01:46:07,279
...if we don't go after those valiants
who are ready to give their lives for us...

1184
01:46:08,800 --> 01:46:10,599
...then hope will be lost.

1185
01:46:11,040 --> 01:46:13,439
One who does not have hope has no homeland.

1186
01:46:14,360 --> 01:46:20,039
No one knows this better than those devils.

1187
01:46:20,120 --> 01:46:22,519
That's why they want to leave us alone.

1188
01:46:22,520 --> 01:46:25,079
They want to leave us helpless.

1189
01:46:27,200 --> 01:46:32,559
They want to kill those
around us as a lesson to others.

1190
01:46:34,360 --> 01:46:35,439
No.

1191
01:46:36,160 --> 01:46:38,679
I will never allow that.

1192
01:46:39,480 --> 01:46:44,039
I will light the fire of Kayi's resurrection...

1193
01:46:45,160 --> 01:46:47,799
...in front of those infidels in their arena.

1194
01:47:12,120 --> 01:47:13,719
Brother..

1195
01:47:13,720 --> 01:47:16,439
Why did you come? You
should've gone to your husband.

1196
01:47:18,120 --> 01:47:20,279
Why did you do this to us, brother?

1197
01:47:21,400 --> 01:47:24,239
Why did you do it, sister?

1198
01:47:24,240 --> 01:47:27,959
You betrayed Osman Bey and
your state. Why did you do it?

1199
01:47:32,440 --> 01:47:36,679
They will kill you. They
will kill everyone here.

1200
01:47:36,760 --> 01:47:39,519
Even if we die, we will die with honor.

1201
01:47:40,640 --> 01:47:42,559
But you, as a traitor...

1202
01:47:48,040 --> 01:47:49,679
What happened to your arm?

1203
01:47:54,640 --> 01:47:55,759
Are you alright?

1204
01:47:58,160 --> 01:48:00,359
I am telling you that you are going to die!

1205
01:48:02,520 --> 01:48:04,919
Are you still worried about me?

1206
01:48:07,920 --> 01:48:12,479
From now on, you don't
have a brother to protect you.

1207
01:48:14,760 --> 01:48:17,679
Take care of yourself, sister.

1208
01:48:29,680 --> 01:48:30,719
Begum.

1209
01:48:32,400 --> 01:48:36,199
-Don't let Ulugan see you here.
-You traitor dog!

1210
01:48:36,480 --> 01:48:41,359
It's all because of you! You tricked
my sister, everything is because of you!

1211
01:48:42,520 --> 01:48:44,319
The real traitor is you, Yusuf.

1212
01:48:45,080 --> 01:48:47,079
You betrayed both your sister and me.

1213
01:48:47,800 --> 01:48:49,098
If you were with us...

1214
01:48:49,110 --> 01:48:53,039
I'd rather die with honor than
stand next to a dog like you, Ilbay!

1215
01:48:53,480 --> 01:48:58,439
You are a dog who betrayed
your state, your lineage!

1216
01:49:02,920 --> 01:49:06,359
But don't worry. You'll pay for all of it.

1217
01:49:10,760 --> 01:49:12,199
You will!

1218
01:49:12,960 --> 01:49:15,039
You will pay for it!

1219
01:49:22,720 --> 01:49:24,239
Find a way.

1220
01:49:24,440 --> 01:49:25,799
Save my brother.

1221
01:49:25,800 --> 01:49:28,239
Your brother does not bow down, Begum.

1222
01:49:29,080 --> 01:49:30,799
There is no way out from this.

1223
01:49:34,680 --> 01:49:36,399
Let's go before someone sees us.

1224
01:49:50,160 --> 01:49:51,839
Come on! Come on!

1225
01:50:12,800 --> 01:50:15,519
Shut up and be quick.

1226
01:50:15,760 --> 01:50:21,439
The show you are about to watch
will never leave your small minds.

1227
01:50:23,400 --> 01:50:24,439
Come on.

1228
01:50:26,960 --> 01:50:29,439
Shameless dog.

1229
01:50:29,440 --> 01:50:31,559
It will never leave their minds, huh?

1230
01:50:31,680 --> 01:50:33,799
I will leave no mind in you.

1231
01:50:33,800 --> 01:50:35,399
Be patient, Boran Bey.

1232
01:50:37,240 --> 01:50:40,159
Come on come on!

1233
01:50:43,600 --> 01:50:46,639
A simple death is not enough for these dogs.

1234
01:50:48,000 --> 01:50:51,079
We will show that a wolf
does not bow to a jackal.

1235
01:50:51,400 --> 01:50:53,759
We will destroy their idols of arrogance.

1236
01:50:53,760 --> 01:50:57,719
Their heads will be crushed
under those idols today.

1237
01:51:12,320 --> 01:51:14,919
Look at their end.

1238
01:51:15,240 --> 01:51:19,879
This is the end of those who stand with Osman.

1239
01:51:24,040 --> 01:51:29,079
If there's anyone who still sees him
as a savior, he should look at his end.

1240
01:51:29,520 --> 01:51:35,559
Even Osman cannot escape
the cold edge of my sword.

1241
01:51:47,560 --> 01:51:49,559
Is your little bird...

1242
01:51:50,440 --> 01:51:52,359
...still loyal to you?

1243
01:51:53,000 --> 01:51:55,879
Maybe she is the reason
Osman is still alive today.

1244
01:51:55,880 --> 01:51:59,359
Poena would never betray me, Lukas.

1245
01:52:00,120 --> 01:52:03,279
She's closer to me than
anyone else, I'm her only support.

1246
01:52:03,280 --> 01:52:05,559
Still, be careful

1247
01:52:05,800 --> 01:52:08,847
If our plan fails one more
time. I'll know it's because of her.

1248
01:52:08,859 --> 01:52:09,879
Lukas.

1249
01:52:09,880 --> 01:52:12,799
I didn't kill her on the cliff that day.

1250
01:52:12,880 --> 01:52:16,799
But I swear, if it happens again...

1251
01:52:17,480 --> 01:52:19,079
I will kill her.

1252
01:52:24,480 --> 01:52:26,599
I can't witness this, Ilbay.

1253
01:52:27,200 --> 01:52:31,519
Even if he's a traitor, I don't
want to see my brother like this.

1254
01:52:32,320 --> 01:52:34,319
Don't you argue about it.

1255
01:52:35,960 --> 01:52:38,959
Take the Alps with you. Be careful.

1256
01:53:01,000 --> 01:53:03,279
Dastard dogs.

1257
01:53:03,440 --> 01:53:07,399
They've already taken the front
seat for the massacre they'll do.

1258
01:53:08,560 --> 01:53:13,439
They'll carry both their sins
and their punishments together.

1259
01:53:14,320 --> 01:53:16,439
Everyone knows their duty.

1260
01:53:48,480 --> 01:53:53,359
So, you prepared this for my valiants, huh?

1261
01:53:58,880 --> 01:54:00,999
This place will be your nightmare.

1262
01:54:05,080 --> 01:54:06,479
Osman Bey Secret Tent

1263
01:54:15,360 --> 01:54:17,079
Forgive me, aunt.

1264
01:54:27,720 --> 01:54:32,359
How will I give it to her now?

1265
01:54:43,640 --> 01:54:45,439
Meryem.

1266
01:54:52,560 --> 01:54:55,039
Take these to Bala Hatun.

1267
01:54:56,840 --> 01:54:58,639
I should not go now.

1268
01:54:59,680 --> 01:55:00,799
Why?

1269
01:55:02,120 --> 01:55:03,759
It's been ten years..

1270
01:55:05,400 --> 01:55:10,199
She hasn't cooked this meal
since Halime passed away.

1271
01:55:58,320 --> 01:55:59,359
Come, my daughter.

1272
01:56:01,840 --> 01:56:05,919
Bala Hatun, your arm must be tired, let me help.

1273
01:56:05,920 --> 01:56:07,479
No, thank you, my daughter.

1274
01:56:07,520 --> 01:56:09,759
I keep myself busy this way.

1275
01:56:10,600 --> 01:56:15,679
I am worried about Osman Bey and the children.

1276
01:56:16,120 --> 01:56:18,279
Their duty is very hard.

1277
01:56:19,000 --> 01:56:21,279
May Allah help them.

1278
01:56:31,560 --> 01:56:33,479
It smells good, right?

1279
01:56:34,800 --> 01:56:36,679
It smells really good.

1280
01:56:44,120 --> 01:56:46,959
It is a very familiar smell.

1281
01:56:48,040 --> 01:56:49,399
What dish is this?

1282
01:56:50,960 --> 01:56:52,919
It's As soup.

1283
01:56:55,640 --> 01:56:59,159
But the secret is in the herbs inside.

1284
01:57:00,320 --> 01:57:03,159
Its smell reminds me of many memories.

1285
01:57:06,320 --> 01:57:08,639
I haven't made it in a long time.

1286
01:57:09,160 --> 01:57:11,759
When I saw those herbs, I decided to make it.

1287
01:57:13,840 --> 01:57:17,119
-I wonder if my mother used to cook it too.
-She probably did.

1288
01:57:17,120 --> 01:57:18,679
This is a Turkish soup.

1289
01:57:19,240 --> 01:57:21,679
My little daughter used to love it so much.

1290
01:57:22,880 --> 01:57:27,319
I never cooked it after she was gone.

1291
01:57:33,040 --> 01:57:34,359
My Halime...

1292
01:57:36,920 --> 01:57:39,039
...loved its smell.

1293
01:57:40,760 --> 01:57:44,279
Even though she was tiny, she'd
eat more than she was supposed to.

1294
01:57:57,680 --> 01:57:59,759
Be careful, don't burn your mouth.

1295
01:58:00,960 --> 01:58:04,719
My Halime would rush and burn herself.

1296
01:58:09,440 --> 01:58:13,159
Mother, it's delicious. Blow on it, it's hot.

1297
01:58:20,280 --> 01:58:23,039
Slow down, my daughter, you'll burn yourself.

1298
01:58:42,440 --> 01:58:45,079
It's very hot but smells so good.

1299
01:58:46,920 --> 01:58:50,919
Your hands touched those herbs.
That's why this soup is so good.

1300
01:58:50,920 --> 01:58:52,999
Wait, you'll burn your mouth.

1301
01:58:54,520 --> 01:58:55,879
Mother?

1302
01:59:18,600 --> 01:59:20,599
Forgive me, brother.

1303
01:59:24,400 --> 01:59:26,439
Forgive me, brother.

1304
01:59:28,800 --> 01:59:35,639
If I hadn't been exiled from the
tribe, none of this would've happened.

1305
01:59:36,080 --> 01:59:41,159
Bala, Gonca... they'll both pay the price.

1306
01:59:42,600 --> 01:59:45,319
They are the reason for my betrayal.

1307
01:59:50,320 --> 01:59:52,479
And I'll be the reason for their death.

1308
01:59:53,480 --> 01:59:54,719
You..

1309
01:59:56,040 --> 02:00:01,759
Turks with broken wings,
who have lost your freedom.

1310
02:00:04,320 --> 02:00:08,679
And you, foolish Greeks
who bowed down to Osman...

1311
02:00:08,680 --> 02:00:12,799
...even though he ruined your lands.

1312
02:00:13,920 --> 02:00:17,119
All this preparation in the square is for you.

1313
02:00:19,360 --> 02:00:26,079
Today, you will watch the end of
the state you sacrificed your lives for.

1314
02:00:29,680 --> 02:00:34,799
Your Osman Bey, who dragged
you to death, is gone now!

1315
02:00:37,400 --> 02:00:40,879
Your free and powerful state does not exist!

1316
02:00:43,640 --> 02:00:47,839
I see that you don't even
have the strength to fight back.

1317
02:00:49,800 --> 02:00:51,199
Soon..

1318
02:00:51,720 --> 02:00:56,959
Soon, the scene you'll watch
will be a lesson for all of you.

1319
02:00:57,800 --> 02:00:59,079
Hristo.

1320
02:01:00,400 --> 02:01:02,839
Bring Osman's loyal Alps.

1321
02:01:10,240 --> 02:01:16,439
This arena will echo with the screams of
those who speak his name and follow his cause.

1322
02:01:17,440 --> 02:01:18,639
Lukas.

1323
02:01:49,960 --> 02:01:51,839
Today this arena..

1324
02:01:52,840 --> 02:01:55,799
...will be echoed with your screams, Lukas.

1325
02:01:58,000 --> 02:02:01,519
-Are you a man?
-What is he doing here?

1326
02:02:01,960 --> 02:02:05,599
He has a death wish. Nokers(Mongolian Soldiers)!

1327
02:02:06,200 --> 02:02:08,479
Stop, stop!

1328
02:02:11,800 --> 02:02:17,079
As Osman has come to his death himself.

1329
02:02:17,600 --> 02:02:19,519
...let's hear his final words.

1330
02:02:19,640 --> 02:02:22,679
We'll see if you are a man or not.

1331
02:02:25,800 --> 02:02:29,719
To show your strength against my people and beys

1332
02:02:31,560 --> 02:02:34,079
...you organized this execution, huh?

1333
02:02:36,720 --> 02:02:38,839
Alright, alright.

1334
02:02:39,480 --> 02:02:41,119
Here we go.

1335
02:02:42,760 --> 02:02:44,559
Do you have a heart for this?

1336
02:02:45,760 --> 02:02:49,719
Fight me if you do. Huh?

1337
02:02:50,240 --> 02:02:52,479
One-one-one fight.

1338
02:02:53,920 --> 02:02:58,199
I'm putting forward my own
life in return for my alps' lives.

1339
02:03:00,000 --> 02:03:01,959
You have a heart for this?

1340
02:03:04,360 --> 02:03:07,919
Those who you hide behind
and work together with...

1341
02:03:08,560 --> 02:03:10,199
Anyone can fight me.

1342
02:03:10,360 --> 02:03:13,959
You need to finish our interrupted fight, huh?

1343
02:03:14,600 --> 02:03:20,839
I will kill you before people
with pleasure, Osman.

1344
02:03:21,200 --> 02:03:23,119
Draw back!

1345
02:03:24,000 --> 02:03:25,839
Bring my shield.

1346
02:03:27,400 --> 02:03:30,319
-Give him too.
-I don't want a shield.

1347
02:03:34,040 --> 02:03:35,879
Do you think...

1348
02:03:37,440 --> 02:03:39,759
...this shield can protect you from my wrath?

1349
02:04:08,600 --> 02:04:11,719
We kept you waiting. You must be bored.

1350
02:04:12,720 --> 02:04:16,159
Don't worry. All of you
are going to die shortly.

1351
02:04:19,360 --> 02:04:21,919
Soldiers, prepare them.

1352
02:04:22,360 --> 02:04:25,719
Chain their feet and bring them to the arena.

1353
02:05:04,160 --> 02:05:06,239
Stupid Lukas.

1354
02:05:06,440 --> 02:05:09,119
No need for a fight. Just kill him.

1355
02:05:09,320 --> 02:05:11,359
Even if Osman win

1356
02:05:11,680 --> 02:05:13,879
...he can't get out of here alive.

1357
02:05:20,400 --> 02:05:23,519
Look around.Turn around and look.

1358
02:05:24,280 --> 02:05:26,759
These are your last seconds.

1359
02:05:27,760 --> 02:05:29,839
This is the end..

1360
02:05:30,360 --> 02:05:35,519
...for those like you who
brought oppression in these lands.

1361
02:05:43,000 --> 02:05:44,799
This is your last day.

1362
02:05:44,960 --> 02:05:48,039
You'll wish you had never come here today.

1363
02:05:49,760 --> 02:05:52,239
-Come on, my Bey!
-Come on!

1364
02:06:00,320 --> 02:06:02,319
Come on, my Bey?

1365
02:06:33,240 --> 02:06:35,679
Get off! We aren't cowards!

1366
02:06:36,720 --> 02:06:40,439
We'll walk even if the way leads to death! Alps!

1367
02:06:41,080 --> 02:06:45,199
Get your heads up! Death is glorious for us!

1368
02:06:46,040 --> 02:06:50,679
I just pray to Almighty Allah that He won't
let those dastards be happy with our deaths!

1369
02:06:50,880 --> 02:06:54,199
Move! You're going to die but still talking!

1370
02:06:56,960 --> 02:06:58,119
Stop there.

1371
02:06:58,520 --> 02:07:02,959
Only Allah decides who dies first.

1372
02:07:03,640 --> 02:07:05,999
O Allah

1373
02:07:33,320 --> 02:07:35,479
My Bey? Orhan Bey.

1374
02:07:35,680 --> 02:07:38,399
Alaaddin Bey, Boran Bey.
How did you get in here?

1375
02:07:38,520 --> 02:07:40,279
Spread your arms.

1376
02:07:44,880 --> 02:07:47,799
Where is Osman Bey? What is he doing?

1377
02:07:49,760 --> 02:07:52,479
They think they can trick us.

1378
02:07:52,880 --> 02:07:54,279
Let them play.

1379
02:07:54,480 --> 02:07:57,879
They want to slaughter my Beys and alps.

1380
02:07:58,040 --> 02:08:00,839
So they will spread terror in hearts.

1381
02:08:01,240 --> 02:08:02,879
Don't worry.

1382
02:08:03,080 --> 02:08:05,599
-They won't succeed.
-My Bey.

1383
02:08:05,880 --> 02:08:08,439
What is our plan?

1384
02:08:09,160 --> 02:08:10,599
Well..

1385
02:08:12,320 --> 02:08:14,479
I will stall Lukas in the fighting area.

1386
02:08:15,040 --> 02:08:16,759
Then..

1387
02:08:17,200 --> 02:08:19,879
All the eyes will be on us.

1388
02:08:20,400 --> 02:08:24,799
And will save the alps and Yusuf in the back.

1389
02:08:25,320 --> 02:08:27,079
Exactly, son.

1390
02:08:28,000 --> 02:08:29,399
But..

1391
02:08:29,480 --> 02:08:32,799
Father, you will be alone.

1392
02:08:33,280 --> 02:08:35,279
That's too dangerous.

1393
02:08:35,480 --> 02:08:38,959
-You may be hurt. -Alaaddin.

1394
02:08:39,800 --> 02:08:43,359
You can't be Egypt's Sultan
before you fall into the pit.

1395
02:08:43,880 --> 02:08:45,639
Don't worry.

1396
02:08:46,160 --> 02:08:48,599
We will ruin their plans.

1397
02:08:49,480 --> 02:08:52,359
-God willing, my Bey.
-God willing, my Bey.

1398
02:08:52,440 --> 02:08:56,239
-God willing.
-We will.

1399
02:08:58,040 --> 02:09:01,399
Osman is fighting on his own for us, huh?

1400
02:09:01,720 --> 02:09:04,639
Yes. We need to get out of here quickly.

1401
02:09:04,960 --> 02:09:08,279
-My father can't stall him any longer.
-It's hard to get out of here.

1402
02:09:08,720 --> 02:09:10,679
But not impossible.

1403
02:09:11,000 --> 02:09:13,679
Alps! Brothers!

1404
02:09:13,760 --> 02:09:16,119
It's time to fight now.

1405
02:09:16,160 --> 02:09:18,319
-May Allah bless our fight.
-Aameen.

1406
02:09:18,320 --> 02:09:20,239
-Let's go!
-Let's go.

1407
02:09:33,920 --> 02:09:36,039
Hold on, my Bey!

1408
02:10:11,320 --> 02:10:13,039
Come on, Lukas.

1409
02:10:13,400 --> 02:10:18,039
I remember the first day I came to the
frontiers to stop a barbarian shepherd, Osman.

1410
02:10:18,240 --> 02:10:24,119
-Finally... Finally, this is it.
-You're right.

1411
02:10:25,120 --> 02:10:27,519
I'm a kind of shepherd.

1412
02:10:27,840 --> 02:10:30,399
But we don't herd pigs.

1413
02:10:53,400 --> 02:10:55,519
For Baysungur.

1414
02:11:01,360 --> 02:11:05,559
This is for Bayhan Bey and all the martyrs.

1415
02:11:24,880 --> 02:11:30,079
For the vengeance of my unborn grandchild.

1416
02:11:37,200 --> 02:11:38,559
Lukas.

1417
02:11:52,040 --> 02:11:54,039
This place...

1418
02:11:55,480 --> 02:11:57,919
...will be watered with your blood today.

1419
02:12:18,200 --> 02:12:20,159
Nokers(Mongolian Soldiers)!

1420
02:12:29,880 --> 02:12:33,239
I'm Osman Bey, Bey of Kayi!

1421
02:12:34,640 --> 02:12:38,839
I'm one of a thousand Turkish soldiers.

1422
02:12:39,480 --> 02:12:44,359
The dog who dishonored
my banner, harmed my state...

1423
02:12:45,480 --> 02:12:49,079
...and oppressed my innocent people...

1424
02:12:50,440 --> 02:12:52,399
...is under my feet now.

1425
02:13:06,840 --> 02:13:10,799
I swear on the land I step on, the sword I hold.

1426
02:13:10,880 --> 02:13:15,879
...and the lives I took for Allah's cause...

1427
02:13:17,720 --> 02:13:21,359
I swear that dastards like you...

1428
02:13:23,120 --> 02:13:25,759
Rats like you...

1429
02:13:31,960 --> 02:13:36,799
...will end up under my feet just like this dog.